//www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7610276719097859348"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Terdapat dua empayar besar di Malaysia, iaitu Kedah Tua (zaman BC) dan Melaka (zaman AD), dan pelaburan besi di Kedah berhenti sekitar 1,300 M.", "g": "tamadun,besi", "p": "pelaburan besi di Kedah berhenti 1,300 Ad sebab itu buku buku sejarah kita tak cerita pasal suasana di empaya Kedah tua", "baru": true, "ulang": [{"tt": "7610276719097859348", "p": "pelaburan besi di Kedah berhenti 1,300 Ad sebab itu buku buku sejarah kita tak cerita pasal suasana di empaya Kedah tua"}], "id": "T237-01", "en": {"t": "There were two great empires in Malaysia, namely Old Kedah (BC era) and Melaka (AD era), and iron investment in Kedah stopped around 1,300 CE."}}, {"t": "Semenanjung Malaysia dan seluruh kawasan ini tenggelam pada 6000 SM, bersamaan zaman Banjir Besar Nabi Nuh yang menenggelamkan seluruh dunia.", "g": "sains,agama", "p": "semenanjung Malaysia dan seluruh kawasan ini tenggelam pada 6000 BC 6,000 tahun yang silam ialah bersamaan dengan zaman bagi Nabi Nuh", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti geologi bagi banjir sejagat tunggal pada 6000 SM; naiknya paras laut yang menenggelamkan Sundaland berlaku beransur-ansur sekitar 14,000-8,000 tahun lalu.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7610276719097859348", "p": "semenanjung Malaysia dan seluruh kawasan ini tenggelam pada 6000 BC 6,000 tahun yang silam ialah bersamaan dengan zaman bagi Nabi Nuh"}], "awal": true, "id": "T237-02", "en": {"t": "Peninsular Malaysia and this entire region was submerged in 6000 BCE, coinciding with the time of the Great Flood of Prophet Noah that submerged the whole world.", "n": "There is no geological evidence for a single global flood in 6000 BCE; the sea level rise that submerged Sundaland occurred gradually around 14,000-8,000 years ago."}}, {"t": "Peta bertarikh 475 M menunjukkan Sumatera, Borneo, Filipina dan Sulawesi sebagai 'all Malays', bermakna orang Melayu sudah wujud 100 tahun sebelum lahir Rasulullah.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "peta bertarikh 4 7 5 A D ... ditulis all Malays Sumatera Borneo Philippines Malays Sulawesi", "baru": true, "ulang": [{"tt": "7610276719097859348", "p": "peta bertarikh 4 7 5 A D ... ditulis all Malays Sumatera Borneo Philippines Malays Sulawesi"}], "id": "T237-03", "en": {"t": "A map dated 475 CE shows Sumatra, Borneo, the Philippines and Sulawesi as 'all Malays', meaning the Malays already existed 100 years before the Messenger of God was born."}}], "tt": "7610276719097859348", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malays are the original people of the Malay Land", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 80K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "W08", "tarikh": "Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03", "tajuk": "Srivijaya empayar Islam; Malaysia tenggelam ketika Banjir Nuh", "platform": "Media sosial (dibidas SEA Heritage & History dan Prof James Chin)", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "Focus Malaysia, 6 Mac 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/?p=237051"}, {"l": "Blog KTemoc, 3 Mac 2026", "u": "https://ktemoc.blogspot.com/2026/03/prof-solehah-yaacob-srivijaya-was.html"}], "d": [{"t": "Srivijaya ialah sebuah empayar Islam.", "g": "islam", "v": "Salah", "n": "Yijing (abad ke-7) catat lebih 1,000 sami Buddha di Srivijaya; inskripsinya Buddha Mahayana.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7611505897809939733", "p": "sriwijaya ni adalah Islam kalau kita faham"}, {"tt": "7553852242319658256", "p": "kerajaan sriwijaya adalah kerajaan Islam kerajaan Melayu Islam yang beragama Hanifah"}, {"tt": "7602149048870554900", "p": "sriwijaya adalah kerajaan Islam"}], "id": "W08-01", "fatal": 6, "sang": [17, 26], "ruj": [{"l": "Srivijaya (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Srivijaya"}, {"l": "Catatan Yijing, abad ke-7 (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yijing_(monk)", "le": "Yijing's records, 7th century (Wikipedia)"}, {"l": "Focus Malaysia, 6 Mac 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/?p=237051", "le": "Focus Malaysia, 6 Mar 2026"}], "en": {"t": "Srivijaya was an Islamic empire.", "n": "Yijing (7th century) recorded over 1,000 Buddhist monks in Srivijaya; its inscriptions are Mahayana Buddhist."}}, {"t": "Malaysia tenggelam ketika Banjir Besar Nabi Nuh, dan tamadun Melayu sudah wujud sebelum banjir itu.", "g": "tamadun,agama", "id": "W08-02", "en": {"t": "Malaysia was submerged during Noah's Great Flood, and Malay civilisation already existed before that flood."}}], "nota": "", "en": {"tajuk": "Srivijaya an Islamic empire; Malaysia submerged in Noah's Flood", "platform": "Social media (criticised by SEA Heritage & History and Prof James Chin)", "tarikh": "Mar 2026"}}, {"id": "T238", "tarikh": "17 Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03-17", "tajuk": "British Museum tiada manuskrip Alam Melayu sebelum 1300?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7618032289544490248", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7618032289544490248"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "British Museum menyatakan hanya menyimpan manuskrip Alam Melayu dari 1300 M ke atas, tiada maklumat sebelum Masihi atau 600 M.", "g": "konspirasi,tamadun", "p": "dia kata we only have one three zero zero Ad one three zero zero Ad above", "baru": true, "id": "T238-01", "en": {"t": "The British Museum states that it only holds Malay World manuscripts from 1300 CE onwards, with no information from before the Common Era or from 600 CE."}}, {"t": "Said Husain Jamaluddin al-Kubra datang ke Kedah Tua melalui Sungai Batu dan berkahwin dengan Puteri Linang Bulan di Kelantan.", "g": "tokoh,islam", "p": "telah berkahwin dengan Puteri linangan bulan Puteri lindungan bulan Puteri linang tu dia kahwin dengan di Kelantan", "baru": true, "id": "T238-02", "en": {"t": "Said Husain Jamaluddin al-Kubra came to Old Kedah via Sungai Batu and married Princess Linang Bulan in Kelantan."}}, {"t": "Orang Champa yang kalah diserang selatan China dipindahkan kerajaan Uthmaniyah ke Patani, Kedah, Aceh dan Kelantan.", "g": "tamadun,tokoh", "p": "siapakah memindahkan orang orang ini ke bahagian bawah kat sini dah ada orang dah orang Melayu dah ada semasa tu siapa kerajaan Osman", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada sumber sejarah yang menunjukkan Uthmaniyah memindahkan orang Champa; penghijrahan Cham ke Semenanjung dan Sumatera lazimnya dikaitkan dengan kejatuhan Vijaya pada 1471.", "awal": true, "id": "T238-03", "en": {"t": "The Champa people, defeated in an attack from southern China, were relocated by the Ottoman government to Patani, Kedah, Aceh and Kelantan.", "n": "No historical source shows that the Ottomans relocated the Champa people; Cham migration to the Peninsula and Sumatra is usually linked to the fall of Vijaya in 1471."}}], "tt": "7618032289544490248", "en": {"tajuk": "Does the British Museum have no Malay World manuscripts from before 1300?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T239", "tarikh": "20 Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03-20", "tajuk": "Penyelewengan sejarah dunia bermula dengan penyelewengan keturunan nabi-nabi", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 38 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7619145915802209554", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7619145915802209554"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nabi-nabi bukan berbangsa Yahudi tetapi proto-Arab; umat Islam disalahfahamkan oleh penulisan Barat.", "g": "agama,konspirasi", "p": "nabi nabi bukan dari bukan berbangsa Yahudi kita telah disalahfahamkan oleh penulisan western", "baru": true, "id": "T239-01", "en": {"t": "The prophets were not of Jewish descent but proto-Arab; Muslims have been misled by Western writings."}}, {"t": "Menurut Abu al-Fida, 'Yahudi' mewakili orang Rom, Arab, Parsi dan Habsyi; Petra (Nabatin) ialah stesen persinggahan sebelum ke Palestin.", "g": "agama,tamadun", "p": "Yahudi ini adalah mewakili orang Rum mewakili orang Arab mewakili orang Parsi mewakili orang Habsyi", "baru": true, "id": "T239-02", "en": {"t": "According to Abu al-Fida, 'Jew' represents Romans, Arabs, Persians and Abyssinians; Petra (Nabatean) was a stopover station before Palestine."}}, {"t": "Syis ialah bapa kepada manusia (keturunan para nabi), melalui Idris dan Nuh; anak Nuh ada lima dan Aram ialah cucu Nuh yang kelima daripada Sam, asal nama Damsyik (Kota Aram).", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "shes itu melahirkan keturunan ambyak itu daripada Idris kemudian Nuh ... damship sekarang itulah dikenali sebagai Kota aram", "baru": true, "id": "T239-03", "en": {"t": "Seth (Syis) is the father of mankind (the lineage of the prophets), through Idris and Noah; Noah had five sons, and Aram was Noah's grandson, the fifth from Shem, the origin of the name Damascus (City of Aram)."}}, {"t": "Bahasa Ibrani tidak boleh dinisbahkan kepada Eber bin Shalih kerana Eber hidup sebelum Nabi Ibrahim; maka dakwaan Nabi Musa bercakap Ibrani dan Taurat asal ditulis dalam Ibrani adalah tidak tepat.", "g": "bahasa,agama", "p": "bagaimana dia boleh claim bahasa Nabi Musa Alaihissalam itu bahasa ibru ... bahasa hiburu kalau dinisbahkan kepada abir bin shalih adalah tidak tepat", "baru": true, "id": "T239-04", "en": {"t": "The Hebrew language cannot be attributed to Eber son of Shalih because Eber lived before Prophet Abraham; therefore the claim that Prophet Moses spoke Hebrew and that the original Torah was written in Hebrew is inaccurate."}}, {"t": "Nabi Musa tidak pernah hidup di Palestin tetapi di Mesir.", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "Nabi Musa tak pernah hidup di Palestin dia hidup di Mesir", "baru": true, "id": "T239-05", "en": {"t": "Prophet Moses never lived in Palestine but in Egypt."}}], "tt": "7619145915802209554", "en": {"tajuk": "The distortion of world history begins with the distortion of the prophets' lineage", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 38K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T240", "tarikh": "26 Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03-26", "tajuk": "Melayu Raya: pidato penuh 23/3/2026", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7621484003694103816", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7621484003694103816"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Ibn Battuta menulis perjalanannya melalui Patani, Kedah dan Kelantan.", "g": "tokoh,tamadun", "p": "Ibnu Batutah telah menulis perjalanannya telah melalui petani Kedah Kelantan", "baru": true, "id": "T240-01", "en": {"t": "Ibn Battuta wrote about his travels through Patani, Kedah and Kelantan."}}, {"t": "Kerajaan Patani, Kedah, Johor dan lain-lain berhubung dengan Uthmaniyah tetapi penjajah membuang buktinya daripada buku teks.", "g": "konspirasi,islam,tamadun", "p": "penjajah ingin menghancurkan ataupun membuang bukti bukti hubungan alam Melayu dengan osmania", "baru": true, "id": "T240-02", "en": {"t": "The kingdoms of Patani, Kedah, Johor and others had relations with the Ottomans, but the colonialists removed the evidence from textbooks."}}], "tt": "7621484003694103816", "en": {"tajuk": "Greater Malaya: full speech of 23/3/2026", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T241", "tarikh": "28 Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03-28", "tajuk": "Ijtimak Antarabangsa Alam Melayu 2-4 April 2026", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 13 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7622366527240588562", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7622366527240588562"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Sejarah Melayu ialah rantaian tidak putus daripada sejarah kenabian bermula Adam, sedangkan di waktu gemilang peradaban Melayu Barat masih dalam kegelapan.", "g": "tamadun,agama", "p": "sejarah peradapan kenabian bermula dengan Adam sejarah Melayu rupanya tatatan yang tidak putus barat masih dalam kegelapan", "baru": true, "id": "T241-01", "en": {"t": "Malay history is an unbroken chain from the history of prophethood beginning with Adam, while at the time of Malay civilisation's glory the West was still in darkness."}}], "tt": "7622366527240588562", "en": {"tajuk": "International Malay World Gathering, 2-4 April 2026", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 13K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "W09", "tarikh": "Mac 2026", "sort": "2026-03b", "tajuk": "Rentap berketurunan Melayu", "platform": "Media sosial (tular)", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "DayakDaily, 13 Mac 2026", "u": "https://dayakdaily.com/dont-rewrite-our-history-activist-slams-claim-linking-rentap-to-malay-narrative/"}, {"l": "Focus Malaysia, 12 Mac 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/prof-solehah-trolled-for-staking-lineage-claim-of-famed-iban-warrior-as-being-of-malay-origin/"}, {"l": "Utusan Borneo, 16 Mac 2026", "u": "https://www.utusanborneo.com.my/2026/03/16/pbds-bantah-kenyataan-ahli-akademik-dakwa-rentap-berketurunan-melayu"}, {"l": "The Rakyat Post, 13 Mac 2026", "u": "https://www.therakyatpost.com/news/malaysia/2026/03/13/flying-rome-rentap-one-malaysian-professors-expanding-universe/"}], "nota": "PBDS minta beliau tarik balik dan mohon maaf kepada masyarakat Dayak; aktivis Peter John Jaban membantah.", "d": [{"t": "Rentap, pahlawan Iban abad ke-19, seorang Melayu.", "g": "tokoh", "id": "W09-01", "ruj": [{"l": "Rentap (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rentap"}], "en": {"t": "Rentap, the 19th-century Iban warrior, was a Malay."}}, {"t": "Rentap keturunan Hang Tuah.", "g": "tokoh", "id": "W09-02", "fatal": 18, "ruj": [{"l": "DayakDaily, 13 Mac 2026", "u": "https://dayakdaily.com/dont-rewrite-our-history-activist-slams-claim-linking-rentap-to-malay-narrative/", "le": "DayakDaily, 13 Mar 2026"}, {"l": "Rentap (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rentap"}], "en": {"t": "Rentap was a descendant of Hang Tuah."}}], "en": {"tajuk": "Rentap of Malay descent", "platform": "Social media (viral)", "tarikh": "Mar 2026", "nota": "PBDS asked her to retract and apologise to the Dayak community; activist Peter John Jaban objected."}}, {"id": "W10", "tarikh": "Sebelum Apr 2026", "sort": "2026-04", "tajuk": "Ceramah di Pattani — Melayu keturunan langsung Nabi Ibrahim", "platform": "Ceramah, Pattani (Selatan Thailand)", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "Focus Malaysia, 3 Apr 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/?p=239846"}], "d": [{"t": "Orang Melayu keturunan langsung Nabi Ibrahim melalui Midian, anak Keturah — isteri ketiga Ibrahim yang berasal dari Champa.", "g": "agama", "v": "Salah", "n": "Midian terletak di barat laut Semenanjung Arab, dekat Teluk Aqabah.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7626367530105376018", "p": "perkataan Melayu itu sudah wujud ketika zaman Nabi Ibrahim Alaihissalam"}, {"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "Melayu ini pula daripada medan medan tadi maksudnya dia adalah anak daripada katurah ... adik beradik sebapak dengan Bani Israel"}, {"tt": "7591349391626079508", "p": "media adalah anak kepada katurah dengan Ibrahim"}], "id": "W10-01", "fatal": 12, "sang": [32, 41], "ruj": [{"l": "Midian, barat laut Semenanjung Arab (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midian", "le": "Midian, north-west Arabian Peninsula (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "The Malays are direct descendants of Prophet Abraham through Midian, son of Keturah — Abraham's third wife, who came from Champa.", "n": "Midian lies in the north-west of the Arabian Peninsula, near the Gulf of Aqaba."}}, {"t": "Tiga bangsa tertua selepas Ibrahim: Bani Israel (Ishak), Arab (Ismail) dan Melayu.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "melahirkan aa Israel Israel daripada Ishak"}], "id": "W10-02", "en": {"t": "The three oldest nations after Abraham: the Israelites (Isaac), the Arabs (Ishmael) and the Malays."}}], "nota": "", "en": {"tajuk": "Lecture in Pattani — Malays are direct descendants of Prophet Abraham", "platform": "Lecture, Pattani (Southern Thailand)", "tarikh": "Before Apr 2026"}}, {"id": "T242", "tarikh": "5 Apr 2026", "sort": "2026-04-05", "tajuk": "Tamadun Melayu bila bermula sebenarnya?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7625350763258137863", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7625350763258137863"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Banjaran Titiwangsa dahulu di dalam laut dan naik akibat gempa besar sehingga menyatukan Kelantan, Terengganu dan Perak; banyak mineral dan permata di situ.", "g": "sains,tamadun", "p": "titi wangsa yang berada di dalam laut itu ... naik ke atas oke", "baru": true, "id": "T242-01", "en": {"t": "The Titiwangsa Range was once under the sea and rose because of a great earthquake, joining Kelantan, Terengganu and Perak; there are many minerals and gemstones there."}}, {"t": "Sundaland ialah Atlantis (Santos), dan Plato dalam The Republic menulis Atlantis sebagai kawasan hijau subur; selepas itu sekumpulan ahli falsafah serta Josephus mengalihkan lokasinya ke Mediterranean untuk menaikkan Eropah.", "g": "tamadun,konspirasi", "p": "Atlantis yang dimaksudkan dalam kitabnya the republic ... kawasan yang banyak tumbuh-tumbuhan yang hijau segar", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Plato menyebut Atlantis dalam Timaeus dan Critias, meletakkannya di luar Pillars of Hercules, dan tiada bukti arkeologi bahawa Atlantis wujud.", "awal": true, "id": "T242-02", "en": {"t": "Sundaland is Atlantis (Santos), and Plato in The Republic wrote of Atlantis as a lush green region; afterwards a group of philosophers and Josephus moved its location to the Mediterranean to elevate Europe.", "n": "Plato mentions Atlantis in Timaeus and Critias, placing it beyond the Pillars of Hercules, and there is no archaeological evidence that Atlantis existed."}}, {"t": "Terdapat piramid di bawah laut di Okinawa (Jepun) dan di Terengganu, bukti tamadun yang tidak diletakkan dalam buku sejarah.", "g": "tamadun,konspirasi", "p": "di kawasan Jepang kita jumpa piramid ... dim trenggano ini sendiri kita jumpa ada", "baru": true, "id": "T242-03", "en": {"t": "There are underwater pyramids in Okinawa (Japan) and in Terengganu, evidence of a civilisation that is not placed in history books."}}], "tt": "7625350763258137863", "en": {"tajuk": "When did Malay civilisation actually begin?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T243", "tarikh": "21 Apr 2026", "sort": "2026-04-21", "tajuk": "Podcast bersama Pak Lang di puncak Gunung Jerai", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 358 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7631186748306885905", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7631186748306885905"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Azan pertama di puncak Gunung Jerai bukan tanda Islam baru masuk; masyarakat Alam Melayu sudah lama mengamalkan syariat Hanif dan azan hanya untuk menyegarkan semula ajaran Islam Nabi Muhammad.", "g": "islam,agama,tamadun", "p": "masyarakatnya sudah lama tahu ... untuk regenerasi ... fahaman syariat Hanif itu terpaksa diazankan semula", "baru": true, "id": "T243-01", "en": {"t": "The first call to prayer (azan) at the summit of Gunung Jerai is not a sign that Islam had only just arrived; the Malay World community had long practised the Hanif sharia, and the azan merely refreshed the teachings of Islam of Prophet Muhammad."}}, {"t": "Syeikh Abdullah al-Qumairi bukan orang pertama yang mengislamkan raja Kedah; beliau hanya guru rohani kepada raja yang sudah memahami syariat Hanif.", "g": "islam,tokoh,agama", "p": "saya yakin syeikh al khumairi itu bukanlah yang pertama yang mengislamkan raja", "baru": true, "id": "T243-02", "en": {"t": "Sheikh Abdullah al-Qumairi was not the first to convert the king of Kedah to Islam; he was merely a spiritual teacher to a king who already understood the Hanif sharia."}}], "tt": "7631186748306885905", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast with Pak Lang at the summit of Gunung Jerai", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 358K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T244", "tarikh": "26 Apr 2026", "sort": "2026-04-26", "tajuk": "Turki Uthmaniah dan Alam Melayu: kenapa sejarah ini lenyap dari buku teks", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7632901664554372359", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7632901664554372359"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kerajaan Uthmaniyah menghalang kapal Portugis, Perancis dan Itali daripada menyerang Kaabah dan daripada datang ke timur.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "mereka boleh menghalang kapal Portugis dan kapal Perancis serta Itali untuk datang menyerang Kaabah dan begitu juga berjaya menghalang daripada untuk datang ke timur", "baru": true, "id": "T244-01", "en": {"t": "The Ottoman Empire blocked Portuguese, French and Italian ships from attacking the Kaaba and from coming to the east."}}, {"t": "Raja Transylvania (Dracula) berkawan dengan iblis dan minum darah kerana marah Uthmaniyah menyerang negerinya; Bosnia dan Bulgaria menjadi Islam hasil kerajaan Uthmaniyah.", "g": "sains,tokoh,islam", "p": "transylvania ... dia berkawan dengan iblis dia minum darah jadi drakula ... bosnya Islam bulgaria dia Islam eropa timur", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Vlad III ialah putera Wallachia dan watak Dracula sebagai pengisap darah ialah fiksyen Bram Stoker (1897); Bulgaria majoritinya Kristian Ortodoks.", "awal": true, "id": "T244-02", "en": {"t": "The king of Transylvania (Dracula) befriended the devil and drank blood out of anger at the Ottomans attacking his country; Bosnia and Bulgaria became Muslim as a result of the Ottoman Empire.", "n": "Vlad III was a prince of Wallachia, and the Dracula character as a blood-drinker is Bram Stoker's fiction (1897); Bulgaria is majority Orthodox Christian."}}, {"t": "Uthmaniyah menghantar bantuan peperangan ke Aceh, Filipina, Champa dan Jawa melalui Alam Melayu, dan terdapat sekitar 1,400 surat hubungan Alam Melayu dengan Uthmaniyah.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "mereka masih lagi menghantarkan peperang kepada Aceh kepada Philippines kepada pihak campak ... saya ingat 1,400 ni ... banyaklah surat", "baru": true, "id": "T244-03", "en": {"t": "The Ottomans sent military aid to Aceh, the Philippines, Champa and Java through the Malay World, and there are around 1,400 letters recording relations between the Malay World and the Ottomans."}}, {"t": "Uthmaniyah meletakkan gabenor/duta sebagai wakil sultan di setiap wilayah Alam Melayu dan Nusantara.", "g": "islam,konspirasi", "p": "setiap wilayah di alam Melayu di Nusantara ini dia letak gabenum ambassador of osmaniyah empaya jadi gabenum ini adalah wakil sultan", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti Uthmaniyah melantik gabenor di Nusantara; wakil rasmi pertama mereka ialah konsul di Batavia pada penghujung abad ke-19.", "awal": true, "id": "T244-04", "en": {"t": "The Ottomans placed governors/envoys as the sultan's representatives in every region of the Malay World and the Nusantara.", "n": "There is no evidence that the Ottomans appointed governors in the Nusantara; their first official representative was a consul in Batavia in the late 19th century."}}, {"t": "Terdapat surat Sultan Ahmad Tajuddin (Kedah) dan Sultan Ibrahim (Johor) kepada Khalifah Uthmaniyah tentang perang dengan musuh dan hubungan dua hala.", "g": "islam,tokoh", "p": "surat daripada kerajaan Kedah sultan Ahmad Tajuddin mengadu tentang perang musuh bisik ... surat yang ke-2 ... sultan Johor sultan Ibrahim", "baru": true, "id": "T244-05", "en": {"t": "There are letters from Sultan Ahmad Tajuddin (Kedah) and Sultan Ibrahim (Johor) to the Ottoman Caliph about wars with enemies and bilateral relations."}}], "tt": "7632901664554372359", "en": {"tajuk": "The Ottoman Empire and the Malay World: why this history vanished from textbooks", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T245", "tarikh": "3 Mei 2026", "sort": "2026-05-03", "tajuk": "Istilah dapat mengubah sejarah dunia", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 55 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7635457971564055815", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7635457971564055815"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Dalam tulisan Arab, Srivijaya dipanggil 'Zabaj' dan meliputi Vietnam, Sumatera dan Semenanjung Malaysia; Srivijaya tidak akan dijumpai dalam tulisan Arab dengan nama itu.", "g": "tamadun,bahasa", "p": "jika anda baca dalam tulisan Arab anda tidak akan jumpa perkataan sriwijaya dia tulis apa zabat zabat itu adalah sriwijaya", "baru": true, "id": "T245-01", "en": {"t": "In Arabic writings, Srivijaya is called 'Zabaj' and covered Vietnam, Sumatra and Peninsular Malaysia; Srivijaya will not be found in Arabic writings under that name."}}, {"t": "Catatan Cina menukar nama raja Melayu mengikut bunyi Cina; 'Cik Bunga' ialah sebutan Cina bagi Sultan Zainal Abidin dan 'Isyarnah' bagi Hisham.", "g": "bahasa,tokoh", "p": "sultan Zana Abidin dicampak itu namanya cik bunga cik bunga", "baru": true, "id": "T245-02", "en": {"t": "Chinese records altered the names of Malay kings to match Chinese sounds; 'Cik Bunga' is the Chinese rendering of Sultan Zainal Abidin and 'Isyarnah' of Hisham."}}], "tt": "7635457971564055815", "en": {"tajuk": "Terminology can change world history", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 55K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T246", "tarikh": "5 Mei 2026", "sort": "2026-05-05", "tajuk": "Agama syahadat orang Melayu dan migrasi", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 34 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7636429570836679944", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7636429570836679944"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Terdapat 400,000 orang Yahudi di Thailand, dan sekumpulan daripada mereka menuduh Baba Lutfi (Patani) mencuri manuskrip Bani Israel.", "g": "konspirasi", "p": "sudah ada 400,000 orang orang Israel orang orang Yahudi itu di bumi Thailand sekarang ini", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Komuniti Yahudi di Thailand dianggarkan jauh lebih kecil, hanya beberapa ribu paling banyak.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "sudah ada 400,000 orang orang Israel orang orang Yahudi itu di bumi Thailand sekarang ini"}], "awal": true, "id": "T246-01", "en": {"t": "There are 400,000 Jews in Thailand, and a group of them accused Baba Lutfi (Patani) of stealing Bani Israel manuscripts.", "n": "The Jewish community in Thailand is estimated to be far smaller, at most a few thousand."}}, {"t": "Tokku Paloh (Terengganu) menggunakan ilmu untuk mencipta ribut di laut supaya Belanda dan British tidak dapat menakluki Terengganu.", "g": "mistik,tokoh", "p": "takku paluh daripada negeri Terengganu menggunakan teknik ini kaedah ini ilmu ini untuk buat ribut di laut", "baru": true, "ulang": [{"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "takku paluh daripada negeri Terengganu menggunakan teknik ini kaedah ini ilmu ini untuk buat ribut di laut"}], "id": "T246-02", "en": {"t": "Tokku Paloh (Terengganu) used esoteric knowledge to create storms at sea so that the Dutch and British could not conquer Terengganu."}}, {"t": "Syeikh Wan Ahmad al-Fatani mencipta kaedah membuat emas dengan mencampurkan telur putih, karang laut dan pasir lalu dipanaskan 3-4 hari, dan emas itu dijual kepada pedagang India.", "g": "mistik,sains,tokoh", "p": "mencampurkan telur putih mencampurkan karang karang laut dan pasir ... panaskan dalam suhu yang tinggi selama 3 4 hari maka akhirnya terkeluarlah emas", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Emas ialah unsur kimia yang tidak boleh dihasilkan daripada telur putih, karang dan pasir melalui pemanasan biasa.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "mencampurkan telur putih mencampurkan karang karang laut dan pasir ... panaskan dalam suhu yang tinggi selama 3 4 hari maka akhirnya terkeluarlah emas"}], "awal": true, "id": "T246-03", "en": {"t": "Sheikh Wan Ahmad al-Fatani invented a method of making gold by mixing egg white, sea coral and sand and heating it for 3-4 days, and the gold was sold to Indian traders.", "n": "Gold is a chemical element that cannot be produced from egg white, coral and sand by ordinary heating."}}], "tt": "7636429570836679944", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malay religion of the shahada and migration", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 34K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T247", "tarikh": "26 Mei 2026", "sort": "2026-05-26", "tajuk": "Analisa sejarah bahasa sebelum kitab Taurat", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7644010234842795272", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7644010234842795272"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Pendeta Yahudi menyalin semula maklumat sebelum Nabi Musa (Mesopotamia zaman Nuh dan Ibrahim) ke dalam Taurat baharu sambil menyembunyikan data asal.", "g": "agama,konspirasi", "p": "pendeta pendeta Yahudi menyalin semula maklumat maklumat ini dan kemudian menulisnya semula ke dalam kitab Taurat yang baru", "baru": true, "id": "T247-01", "en": {"t": "Jewish scholars recopied information from before Prophet Moses (Mesopotamia in the time of Noah and Abraham) into a new Torah while concealing the original data."}}], "tt": "7644010234842795272", "en": {"tajuk": "Analysis of the history of language before the Torah", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T14", "tarikh": "31 Mei 2026", "sort": "2026-05-31", "tajuk": "“Melayu wajib bersatu… Kedah, Kelantan, Terengganu, Perlis itu Patani Besar”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 130 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7645865027907423506", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7645865027907423506"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Universiti Sains Malaysia membuktikan DNA Melayu sudah wujud 60,000 tahun lalu.", "g": "sains", "v": "Salah", "n": "Penyelidikan genetik menunjukkan leluhur utama Melayu ialah penutur Austronesia yang tiba 5,000–7,000 tahun lalu.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7621484003694103816", "p": "Melayu itu sudah ada DNA yang 60,000 tahun yang lalu ini dibuat oleh kajian di universiti sains Malaysia"}], "id": "T14-01", "en": {"t": "Universiti Sains Malaysia proved Malay DNA already existed 60,000 years ago.", "n": "Genetic research shows the main Malay ancestry comes from Austronesian speakers who arrived 5,000–7,000 years ago."}}, {"t": "Kedah, Kelantan, Terengganu dan Perlis sebahagian daripada “Patani Besar”.", "g": "tamadun", "id": "T14-02", "en": {"t": "Kedah, Kelantan, Terengganu and Perlis are part of “Greater Patani”."}}], "tt": "7645865027907423506", "en": {"tajuk": "“Malays must unite… Kedah, Kelantan, Terengganu and Perlis are Greater Patani”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 130K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T248", "tarikh": "4 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-04", "tajuk": "Bicara buku Lingua Revolution dan peradaban Melayu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7647558161431317768", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7647558161431317768"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Adam melihat tertulis 'La ilaha illallah Muhammad Rasulullah' apabila dihidupkan dan menulis catatan atas tanah liat yang musnah dalam banjir Nuh, maka tulisan sebelum banjir tiada.", "g": "agama,bahasa", "p": "Adam alaihissalam dibangkitkan ... melihat tertulis di sekitar itu la ilaha illallah Muhammad dan rasulullah ... menulis beberapa catatan di atas tanah liat namun ianya musnah", "baru": true, "id": "T248-01", "en": {"t": "Adam, upon being brought to life, saw 'La ilaha illallah Muhammad Rasulullah' written, and wrote records on clay that were destroyed in Noah's flood, hence no writing from before the flood survives."}}, {"t": "Banjir Nuh bukan disebabkan hujan sahaja tetapi air memancar dari perut bumi (tannur) yang menenggelamkan gunung-ganang.", "g": "agama,sains", "p": "banjir besar nabi nuh itu melepasi semua gunung ... air itu daripada perut bumi ... dia bukan saja air daripada langit", "baru": true, "id": "T248-02", "en": {"t": "Noah's flood was not caused by rain alone but by water gushing from the belly of the earth (tannur), which submerged the mountains."}}, {"t": "Perkataan 'Srivijaya' ialah nama ciptaan orientalis sekitar 1800-an dan raja pada 500-700 M tidak tahu mereka 'Srivijaya'; beliau menamakannya gugusan kerajaan Melayu maritim.", "g": "bahasa,tamadun", "p": "raja-raja yang ada pada waktu tahu dia sriwijaya ... orientalis sekitar 1000 lapan ratus ke atas je", "baru": true, "id": "T248-03", "en": {"t": "The word 'Srivijaya' is a name coined by orientalists around the 1800s, and the kings of 500-700 CE did not know they were 'Srivijaya'; she calls it a cluster of Malay maritime kingdoms."}}], "tt": "7647558161431317768", "en": {"tajuk": "Discussion of the book Lingua Revolution and Malay civilisation", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T249", "tarikh": "8 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-08", "tajuk": "Melayu dan peradaban dunia (Bahagian 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7648843742052453640", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7648843742052453640"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Akhiran 'warman' pada nama Indravarman hanya ditambah pada abad ke-7 M oleh penulis Hindu; nama sebenar raja itu Indera Jaya, dan ini salah satu manipulasi pemikiran Melayu.", "g": "bahasa,konspirasi", "p": "warman itu ialah istilah yang baru sahaja diletak pada kurun yang ke-7 masehi oleh penulis penulis Hindu", "baru": true, "id": "T249-01", "en": {"t": "The suffix 'warman' in the name Indravarman was only added in the 7th century CE by Hindu writers; the king's real name was Indera Jaya, and this is one of the manipulations of Malay thought."}}, {"t": "Ashabul Kahfi hidup sekitar 250 SM, sebelum Kristian wujud, dan beragama tauhid mengikut syariat Musa.", "g": "agama,islam", "p": "ashabul Kahfi 250 sebelum Masihi Kristian tak ada lagi ... dia ikut syariah Musa", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Tradisi menempatkan Ashabul Kahfi pada zaman Maharaja Decius sekitar 250 M (abad ke-3 Masihi), bukan 250 SM.", "awal": true, "id": "T249-02", "en": {"t": "The People of the Cave (Ashabul Kahfi) lived around 250 BCE, before Christianity existed, and followed monotheism according to the law of Moses.", "n": "Tradition places the People of the Cave in the time of Emperor Decius around 250 CE (3rd century CE), not 250 BCE."}}], "tt": "7648843742052453640", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malays and world civilisation (Part 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T250", "tarikh": "15 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-15", "tajuk": "Alam Melayu wujud sebelum Mesopotamia?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7651641045054164232", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7651641045054164232"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Besi turun daripada langit melalui meteor dan 'beranak' sebab itu bijih besi masih banyak di Sungai Batu di bawah pokok sawit.", "g": "besi,sains", "p": "besi ini turun daripada langit bukannya daripada bumi bila turun tu besi itu dia beranak sebab itu dia tidak hilang", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Besi tidak 'beranak'; bijih besi Sungai Batu ialah bijih terbentuk secara geologi (hematit/limonit/laterit), bukan hasil hujan meteor.", "awal": true, "id": "T250-01", "en": {"t": "Iron came down from the sky through meteors and 'reproduces', which is why iron ore is still abundant at Sungai Batu under the oil palm trees.", "n": "Iron does not 'reproduce'; the iron ore at Sungai Batu is geologically formed ore (hematite/limonite/laterite), not the product of a meteor shower."}}, {"t": "Bangsa Melayu sudah wujud sebelum Nabi Ibrahim dan sebelum Keturah, maka Keturah berasal dari Alam Melayu.", "g": "tamadun,tokoh", "p": "bangsa bangsa malang ini sudah wujud sebelum wujudnya Nabi Ibrahim Alaihissalam sebelum wujudnya katurah lagi", "baru": true, "id": "T250-02", "en": {"t": "The Malay race already existed before Prophet Abraham and before Keturah, so Keturah originated from the Malay World."}}], "tt": "7651641045054164232", "en": {"tajuk": "Did the Malay World exist before Mesopotamia?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T251", "tarikh": "15 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-15", "tajuk": "Mala: bangsa gunung?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7651656203554376968", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7651656203554376968"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nama 'Sriwijaya' hanya diperkenalkan Barat pada 1800 dan orientalis menetapkan bermula 900 M, sedangkan raja-raja Melayu yang hebat itu sudah wujud sejak 600 M tanpa tahu mereka dipanggil Sriwijaya.", "g": "tamadun,konspirasi,bahasa", "p": "istilah seri jaya yang dikemukakan oleh barat pada 1,800 ... seri jayaan sudah muncul 600 Ad ... orang yang berada di dalam ketika itu tidak", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Nama Sriwijaya (Srivijaya) tercatat dalam prasasti kerajaan itu sendiri, iaitu Kedukan Bukit (683 M) dan Kota Kapur (686 M); Coedes hanya mengenal pasti kerajaan itu pada 1918.", "awal": true, "id": "T251-01", "en": {"t": "The name 'Sriwijaya' was only introduced by the West in 1800 and orientalists set its beginning at 900 CE, whereas those great Malay kings already existed from 600 CE without knowing they were called Sriwijaya.", "n": "The name Sriwijaya (Srivijaya) is recorded in the kingdom's own inscriptions, namely Kedukan Bukit (683 CE) and Kota Kapur (686 CE); Coedes only identified the kingdom in 1918."}}], "tt": "7651656203554376968", "en": {"tajuk": "Mala: a mountain people?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T252", "tarikh": "17 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-17", "tajuk": "Kedah bumi laluan para auliya (Bahagian 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7652286400905235719", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7652286400905235719"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Orang Aceh ialah orang Champa yang dipindahkan oleh Kerajaan Uthmaniyah, dan Semenanjung Malaysia dikenali sebagai 'Anatolia Kecil' menurut catatan Sultan Aceh.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "orang aci itu adalah orang campak siapa yang pindahkan mereka kerajaan Osmaniah ... alam semenanjung Malaysia dikenali sebagai anatolia kecil", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Orang Aceh berasal daripada percampuran penduduk tempatan dan migrasi Austronesia; tiada bukti Uthmaniyah memindahkan orang Champa ke Aceh atau menggelar Semenanjung 'Anatolia Kecil'.", "awal": true, "id": "T252-01", "en": {"t": "The Acehnese are Champa people who were relocated by the Ottoman Empire, and the Malay Peninsula was known as 'Little Anatolia' according to the records of the Sultan of Aceh.", "n": "The Acehnese originate from a mixture of local inhabitants and Austronesian migration; there is no evidence that the Ottomans relocated Champa people to Aceh or called the Peninsula 'Little Anatolia'."}}, {"t": "Nama Gunung Jerai berasal daripada perkataan Arab 'sarai' yang bermaksud istana.", "g": "bahasa", "p": "sarai itu bermaksudnya istana ... kita di Gunung Jerai", "baru": true, "id": "T252-02", "en": {"t": "The name Gunung Jerai comes from the Arabic word 'sarai', meaning palace."}}], "tt": "7652286400905235719", "en": {"tajuk": "Kedah, land on the path of the saints (Part 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T253", "tarikh": "17 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-17", "tajuk": "Bahasa tiang negara dan sejarah Kedah Tua", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 27 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7652287577243880712", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7652287577243880712"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Sultan Kedah (Sultan Muzaffar Shah, sebelum itu Phra Ong Mahawangsa) memeluk Islam pada 1135, lebih awal daripada kemunculan Samudera Pasai.", "g": "islam,tokoh", "p": "sultan Kedah sultan muzafar sebelum itu dinama bernama sultan aa praun itu 13 aa 1,103 5 telah masuk Islam", "baru": true, "id": "T253-01", "en": {"t": "The Sultan of Kedah (Sultan Muzaffar Shah, formerly Phra Ong Mahawangsa) embraced Islam in 1135, earlier than the emergence of Samudera Pasai."}}, {"t": "Nabi Khidir ialah menteri penasihat Zulkarnain dan sepupu Nabi Ibrahim berdasarkan genealogi 8x5 kaki beliau, maka mereka hidup serentak.", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "Nabi Ibrahim dengan nabi nabi khaidir ini dia macam sepupu dia sepupu maknanya hidup serentak", "baru": true, "id": "T253-02", "en": {"t": "Prophet Khidir was Zulqarnain's advisory minister and a cousin of Prophet Abraham based on his 8x5 foot genealogy, so they lived at the same time."}}, {"t": "Perlombongan besi di Kedah berhenti pada 1300 M, sebab itu buku sejarah tidak menceritakan Kedah Tua.", "g": "besi,tamadun", "p": "pelaburan besi di Kedah berhenti 1,300 Ad sebab itu buku buku sejarah kita tak cerita", "baru": true, "id": "T253-03", "en": {"t": "Iron mining in Kedah stopped in 1300 CE, which is why history books do not tell of Old Kedah."}}, {"t": "Semenanjung Tanah Melayu dikenali sebagai 'Anatolia Kecil' dalam gambar yang ditulis oleh sultan Aceh di bawah naungan Uthmaniyah.", "g": "tamadun,tokoh", "p": "kita ini alam semenanjung Malaysia dikenali sebagai anatol anatol kecil kita adalah anatolia kecil", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada sumber primer yang diketahui menyebut Semenanjung Tanah Melayu dikenali sebagai 'Anatolia Kecil'.", "awal": true, "id": "T253-04", "en": {"t": "The Malay Peninsula was known as 'Little Anatolia' in a picture written by the Sultan of Aceh under Ottoman patronage.", "n": "No known primary source states that the Malay Peninsula was known as 'Little Anatolia'."}}, {"t": "Peta bertarikh 475 M daripada Eropah menandakan Sumatera, Borneo, Filipina, Sulawesi, Funan dan Champa sebagai kawasan Melayu.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "dia tulis all Malays Sumatera Borneo Philippines Malays Sulawesi", "baru": true, "id": "T253-05", "en": {"t": "A map dated 475 CE from Europe marks Sumatra, Borneo, the Philippines, Sulawesi, Funan and Champa as Malay regions."}}], "tt": "7652287577243880712", "en": {"tajuk": "Language, the pillar of the nation, and the history of Old Kedah", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 27K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T254", "tarikh": "21 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-21", "tajuk": "Melayu dalam jalur Nabi Ibrahim", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7653864691122375956", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7653864691122375956"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Ham berhijrah ke Afrika (berkulit hitam), Sam bangsa Semitik dan Yafith ke Eropah (berkulit putih).", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "Ham ini yang ke Afrika itu yang berkulit hitam", "baru": true, "id": "T254-01", "en": {"t": "Ham migrated to Africa (dark-skinned), Shem is the Semitic race, and Japheth went to Europe (light-skinned)."}}], "tt": "7653864691122375956", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malays in the line of Prophet Abraham", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T255", "tarikh": "22 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-22", "tajuk": "Dinasti al-Kamil, duit syiling Kedah dan Batu Bersurat Terengganu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 21 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7654011510615805185", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7654011510615805185"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Dinasti al-Kamil dengan gelaran Raja Mandalika ialah sistem khalifah yang digunakan di Alam Melayu bermula daripada Syeikh Abdul Qadir Jilani (1078-1166), lalu berpindah ke Terengganu, Sunan Gunung Jati (Cirebon, 1500), Sultan Agung Mataram dan Tokku Pulau Manis; penjajah menutupnya.", "g": "islam,tokoh,konspirasi", "p": "Dinasti al Kamil menggunakan sistem khalifah di alam Melayu ini penjajah memang menutup benda ni bermula daripada syeikh Abdul Qadir jilani", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada sumber sejarah arus perdana yang menyebut \"Dinasti al-Kamil\" atau sistem khalifah bergelar Raja Mandalika di Alam Melayu.", "awal": true, "id": "T255-01", "en": {"t": "The al-Kamil Dynasty with the title Raja Mandalika was a caliphate system used in the Malay World beginning from Sheikh Abdul Qadir Jilani (1078-1166), then moving to Terengganu, Sunan Gunung Jati (Cirebon, 1500), Sultan Agung of Mataram and Tokku Pulau Manis; the colonialists suppressed it.", "n": "No mainstream historical source mentions an 'al-Kamil Dynasty' or a caliphate system titled Raja Mandalika in the Malay World."}}, {"t": "Pedagang India datang ke Alam Melayu hanya sekitar 3 SM, 2 SM atau 1 SM untuk mencari emas selepas pencarian di Siberia (Suvarnabhumi) diganggu orang Sumeria dan Akkadia di Iraq.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "disebabkan usaha mereka di sabaria itu selalu diganggu oleh orang sumarya dan akadia mereka membuat keputusan untuk mencari emas di tempat lain", "baru": true, "id": "T255-02", "en": {"t": "Indian traders came to the Malay World only around 3 BCE, 2 BCE or 1 BCE to look for gold after their search in Siberia (Suvarnabhumi) was disrupted by the Sumerians and Akkadians in Iraq."}}, {"t": "Sami Buddha dari China singgah di sini enam bulan menunggu monsun tetapi tidak membina candi atau batu besar kerana dilarang, sebab ini bumi kerajaan Islam.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "mereka tidak bina batu batu besar kat sini sebab dilarang sebab di sini adalah bumi kerajaan Islam", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Lembah Bujang mempunyai candi Hindu-Buddha berusia kira-kira abad ke-5 hingga ke-12 M; tiada bukti larangan membina candi oleh sebuah kerajaan Islam pada zaman itu.", "awal": true, "id": "T255-03", "en": {"t": "Buddhist monks from China stopped here for six months waiting for the monsoon but did not build temples or large stone structures because they were forbidden, since this was the land of an Islamic kingdom.", "n": "The Bujang Valley has Hindu-Buddhist temples dating from roughly the 5th to 12th centuries CE; there is no evidence that an Islamic kingdom forbade building temples in that period."}}, {"t": "Kupang Kedah (kira-kira 0.6 g) digunakan untuk kiraan zakat setara dinar (4.4 g) dan dirham, membuktikan ada penguasa Islam di Kedah sebelum 1824.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "pembayaran zakat mesti berdasarkan dinar dan dirham sama ada duit kupang Kedah ada 1 penguasa ingat ini sebelum 18 24", "baru": true, "id": "T255-04", "en": {"t": "The Kedah kupang (about 0.6 g) was used for zakat calculation as the equivalent of the dinar (4.4 g) and dirham, proving there was an Islamic ruler in Kedah before 1824."}}], "tt": "7654011510615805185", "en": {"tajuk": "The al-Kamil Dynasty, Kedah coins and the Terengganu Inscription Stone", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 21K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T256", "tarikh": "24 Jun 2026", "sort": "2026-06-24", "tajuk": "Pelayaran Tamadun Islam 3.0: Misteri Penipuan Kapal Rom", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 89 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7654752314917489921", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7654752314917489921"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kira-kira 80 peratus tokoh falsafah Barat seperti William James dan Rene Descartes ialah keturunan Yahudi.", "g": "konspirasi,tokoh", "p": "80 persen daripada mereka adalah descendent Yahudi semuanya", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada data bagi angka 80 peratus itu; Descartes (Katolik Perancis) dan William James (Amerika) tidak dikenali sebagai keturunan Yahudi.", "awal": true, "id": "T256-01", "en": {"t": "Around 80 percent of Western philosophers such as William James and Rene Descartes are of Jewish descent.", "n": "There is no data for the 80 percent figure; Descartes (a French Catholic) and William James (an American) are not known to be of Jewish descent."}}], "tt": "7654752314917489921", "en": {"tajuk": "Voyages of Islamic Civilisation 3.0: The mystery of the Roman ship deception", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 89K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T257", "tarikh": "12 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-12", "tajuk": "Kenapa kita tak tahu asal usul diri sendiri", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 160 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7661510293993901328", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7661510293993901328"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Peta 'Hemisphaerium' bertarikh 475 Masihi (daripada Prof Kopanski) menyebut Sumatera, Semenanjung, Borneo, Filipina dan Sulawesi sebagai kawasan Melayu.", "g": "tamadun,bahasa", "p": "peta ini adalah is hemisphere pada 4 7 5 Ed semua ini saya ambil daripada prof kopanski", "baru": true, "id": "T257-01", "en": {"t": "The 'Hemisphaerium' map dated 475 CE (from Prof Kopanski) mentions Sumatra, the Peninsula, Borneo, the Philippines and Sulawesi as Malay regions."}}], "tt": "7661510293993901328", "en": {"tajuk": "Why we do not know our own origins", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 160K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T258", "tarikh": "18 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-18", "tajuk": "Maksud penjajahan minda", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7663787079150636308", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7663787079150636308"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nabi Adam turun di Sri Lanka lalu ke Tanah Arab dan beranak-pinak di Mekah sebelum manusia bertebaran ke seluruh dunia.", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "dia daripada Sri Lanka dia pergi ke tanah Arab dan aa beranak pinak di situ di Mekah itu", "baru": true, "id": "T258-01", "en": {"t": "Prophet Adam descended in Sri Lanka, then went to the Arabian lands and multiplied in Mecca before humans spread across the world."}}], "tt": "7663787079150636308", "en": {"tajuk": "The meaning of colonisation of the mind", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T259", "tarikh": "22 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-22", "tajuk": "Manuskrip kita diambil: hilangnya memori sebuah bangsa", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 11 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7665410834847255815", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7665410834847255815"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Catatan sejarah orang Melayu wujud tetapi telah diambil penjajah dan disimpan di luar negara.", "g": "konspirasi,tamadun", "p": "Sebenarnya, catatan kita ada tapi diambil orang.", "baru": true, "id": "T259-01", "en": {"t": "Historical records of the Malay people exist but were taken by the colonialists and kept overseas."}}], "tt": "7665410834847255815", "en": {"tajuk": "Our manuscripts were taken: the loss of a people's memory", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 11K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T260", "tarikh": "23 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-23", "tajuk": "Nabi Ibrahim bukan Yahudi (Ali Imran 67)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 8 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7665743745387613458", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7665743745387613458"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Penterjemah yang tidak memahami nahu Arab membuang 'ma' (nafi) dalam Ali Imran 67 sehingga ayat itu dibaca seolah-olah Nabi Ibrahim Yahudi dan Nasrani.", "g": "bahasa,agama,konspirasi", "p": "kalau anda buang mak ataupun wujud mak tapi anda terjemah lain", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada terjemahan atau tafsiran arus perdana Ali Imran 67 yang membuang 'ma'; ayat itu jelas menafikan Ibrahim Yahudi atau Nasrani.", "awal": true, "id": "T260-01", "en": {"t": "Translators who did not understand Arabic grammar removed the 'ma' (negation) in Ali Imran 67, so that the verse reads as if Prophet Abraham were a Jew and a Christian.", "n": "No mainstream translation or interpretation of Ali Imran 67 removes the 'ma'; the verse clearly denies that Abraham was a Jew or a Christian."}}], "tt": "7665743745387613458", "en": {"tajuk": "Prophet Abraham was not a Jew (Ali Imran 67)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 8K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T261", "tarikh": "24 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-24", "tajuk": "Melaka baru wujud 1400?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 36 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7666032462790757639", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7666032462790757639"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Cerita pelanduk dan pokok Melaka juga wujud di selatan Thailand, Champa dan Pasai dengan binatang yang berbeza, jadi ia bukan asal usul sebenar Melaka.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "cerita tu ada juga dekat selatan Thai dekat Thailand cerita yang sama ada juga dekat campak cerita yang sama ada juga kat pasai", "baru": true, "id": "T261-01", "en": {"t": "The story of the mouse deer and the Melaka tree also exists in southern Thailand, Champa and Pasai with different animals, so it is not the true origin of Melaka."}}], "tt": "7666032462790757639", "en": {"tajuk": "Did Melaka only exist from 1400?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 36K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T262", "tarikh": "28 Jul 2026", "sort": "2026-07-28", "tajuk": "Al-Quran menjawab ateisme dan Richard Dawkins", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 544 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7667564925811739925", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7667564925811739925"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Al-Quran menyatakan proses kejadian manusia dalam perut ibu ialah evolusi, tetapi Adam tidak berevolusi kerana kejadiannya berlainan.", "g": "islam,sains", "p": "saya mengatakan manusia itu berevolusi apabila dalam konsep dalam perut ibu tetapi sebelum ni Adam tidak berevolusi", "baru": true, "id": "T262-01", "en": {"t": "The Quran states that the process of human creation in the mother's womb is evolution, but Adam did not evolve because his creation was different."}}], "tt": "7667564925811739925", "en": {"tajuk": "The Quran answers atheism and Richard Dawkins", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 544K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "W11", "tarikh": "Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08", "tajuk": "“BESI DARI LANGIT | MENGAPA KEDAH KAYA DENGAN BESI?”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob dan Facebook (179K tontonan)", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob"}, {"l": "Focus Malaysia, 20 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/prof-solehah-ancient-kedahs-iron-ore-abundance-due-to-meteoric-shower-not-natural-formation/"}, {"l": "The Rakyat Post, 21 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://www.therakyatpost.com/news/malaysia/2026/08/21/iron-from-the-sky-romans-flying-kung-fu-the-theories-keep-coming-the-evidence-keeps-saying-no/"}], "d": [{"t": "Kekayaan bijih besi Kedah Tua berpunca daripada hujan meteor, bukan pembentukan semula jadi.", "g": "besi,sains", "v": "Salah", "n": "Ujian XRF pasukan USM (Mokhtar Saidin) jumpa hematit, magnetit dan goetit; tiada aloi nikel-besi atau struktur Widmanstätten.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7675744559195786516", "p": "besi daripada langit dia hasil daripada meteor kan meteor itu turun tu dia menurungkan besi"}, {"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "besi itu hasil daripada letusan supernoba bukannya bumi yang mengeluarkan besi turunnya meteor ke gunung jerai sungai batu besi berselerak"}], "id": "W11-01", "fatal": 5, "sang": [10, 16, 22], "ruj": [{"l": "Ujian XRF pasukan USM: The Rakyat Post, 21 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://www.therakyatpost.com/news/malaysia/2026/08/21/iron-from-the-sky-romans-flying-kung-fu-the-theories-keep-coming-the-evidence-keeps-saying-no/", "le": "USM team's XRF tests: The Rakyat Post, 21 Aug 2026"}, {"l": "Focus Malaysia, 20 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/prof-solehah-ancient-kedahs-iron-ore-abundance-due-to-meteoric-shower-not-natural-formation/", "le": "Focus Malaysia, 20 Aug 2026"}], "en": {"t": "Old Kedah's wealth of iron ore came from a meteor shower, not natural formation.", "n": "XRF tests by the USM team (Mokhtar Saidin) found haematite, magnetite and goethite; no nickel-iron alloy or Widmanstätten structure."}}, {"t": "Gunung Jerai dan sekitarnya ialah kawasan hentaman meteor.", "g": "besi,sains", "ulang": [{"tt": "7675744559195786516", "p": "kawasan ini adalah kawasan turun meteor kat mana pusat dia tu gunung Jerai"}, {"tt": "7676661410864188673", "p": "Melayu ialah pusat meteor turunnya meteor di situ"}], "id": "W11-02", "sang": [10], "en": {"t": "Gunung Jerai and its surroundings are a meteor impact zone."}}, {"t": "Muka bumi Kedah yang rata, berbeza daripada kawasan Titiwangsa, dikaitkan dengan meteor dan besi di Sungai Batu.", "g": "sains", "ulang": [{"tt": "7675744559195786516", "p": "justru Kedah ini dalam kawah sebab tuh boleh tanam padi dalam kawah meteor"}, {"tt": "7651641045054164232", "p": "Kedah itu kawasan pusat turunnya meteor ... dia kawasan lengkukkan kawah besar hasil daripada turunnya meteor sebab itu dia subur untuk penanaman padi"}, {"tt": "7676661410864188673", "p": "dia sebenarnya kawah besar hasil daripada letupan meretai"}], "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada kawah hentaman meteor yang disahkan di Kedah; besi Sungai Batu dilebur daripada bijih besi tempatan.", "awal": true, "id": "W11-03", "sang": [10, 33], "en": {"t": "Kedah's flat terrain, unlike the Titiwangsa area, is linked to the meteor and the iron at Sungai Batu.", "n": "There is no confirmed meteor impact crater in Kedah; the iron at Sungai Batu was smelted from local iron ore."}}], "nota": "", "en": {"tajuk": "“IRON FROM THE SKY | WHY IS KEDAH RICH IN IRON?”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob and Facebook (179K views)", "tarikh": "Aug 2026"}}, {"id": "T263", "tarikh": "1 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-01", "tajuk": "Duit syiling tidak menipu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 49 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7669092563751554324", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7669092563751554324"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Syiling Rom ditemui di Pekan, Pahang bertarikh 119 SM, bukti Alam Melayu sudah berhubung dengan dunia Rom.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "koin Roman pekan paham bertarif 119 bci dah tulis kat situ", "baru": true, "id": "T263-01", "en": {"t": "Roman coins found in Pekan, Pahang dated 119 BCE are evidence that the Malay World was already in contact with the Roman world."}}], "tt": "7669092563751554324", "en": {"tajuk": "Coins do not lie", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 49K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T16", "tarikh": "2 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-02", "tajuk": "“Istilah boleh mengubah sejarah”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 264 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7669387424245517588", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7669387424245517588"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Palembang pada tahun 600 Masihi berada di dalam laut, jadi Srivijaya tidak bermula di Palembang.", "g": "tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Prasasti Kedukan Bukit (683 M), yang pertama menyebut Srivijaya, dijumpai di Palembang.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7696546793399618822", "p": "Palembang itu sebenarnya 600 masehi tanam lauk oke lautan"}, {"tt": "7351954736247000336", "p": "Sumatera dia pulanya macam sampan senget ... Palembang sekarang ... dulu itu dalam air"}, {"tt": "7696921654064205072", "p": "Palembang itu sebenarnya 600 masehi lautan Bukit seguntang sekarang adalah 29 meter daripada paras laut"}], "id": "T16-01", "sang": [26], "en": {"t": "Palembang was under the sea in 600 CE, so Srivijaya did not begin in Palembang.", "n": "The Kedukan Bukit inscription (683 CE), the first to mention Srivijaya, was found in Palembang."}}, {"t": "Nama “Parameswara” berasal daripada “permaisura/permaisuri”, iaitu nama panggilan.", "g": "bahasa,tokoh", "v": "Salah", "n": "Parameswara daripada Sanskrit parameśvara, “raja/tuan tertinggi”.", "id": "T16-02", "sang": [25], "en": {"t": "The name “Parameswara” comes from “permaisura/permaisuri” (queen consort), i.e. a nickname.", "n": "Parameswara comes from Sanskrit parameśvara, “supreme king/lord”."}}], "tt": "7669387424245517588", "en": {"tajuk": "“Terms can change history”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 264K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T264", "tarikh": "3 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-03", "tajuk": "Bukti yang memusnahkan naratif Eurosentrik", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 42 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7669765511743409425", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7669765511743409425"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Batu granit bertulis 'Ibnu Sardan 213' (setara zaman khalifah al-Makmun) ditemui di Lembah Bujang membuktikan komuniti Islam sudah wujud di Kedah pada abad ke-9.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "tulisan Arab kufi purba atau jawi lama yang tertulis Ibnu sardan 2 1 3 tarikh ni sepadan betul betul dengan Era pemerintahan khalifah abasiya al", "baru": true, "id": "T264-01", "en": {"t": "A granite stone inscribed 'Ibnu Sardan 213' (equivalent to the time of Caliph al-Ma'mun) found in the Bujang Valley proves that an Islamic community already existed in Kedah in the 9th century."}}, {"t": "Syeikh Abdullah al-Khumairi pada 1136 tidak membawa Islam kepada orang yang tidak tahu apa-apa tetapi melakukan tajdid (pemurnian) bagi kerajaan yang sudah beracuan Islam berabad lamanya.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "bila syeikh Abdullah al khumairi tiba pada 1136 beliau bukanlah bawa Islam kepada orang yang langsung tak tahu apa apa ... proses yang dipanggil tajdit", "baru": true, "id": "T264-02", "en": {"t": "Sheikh Abdullah al-Khumairi in 1136 did not bring Islam to people who knew nothing but carried out tajdid (renewal) for a kingdom that had been shaped by Islam for centuries."}}, {"t": "Stamford Raffles, R.J. Wilkinson dan R.O. Winstedt sengaja mengubah naratif sejarah Kedah melalui nota kaki dan suntingan, merendahkan Hikayat Merong Mahawangsa dan memperkecilkan artifak Islam sebagai barang pedagang asing.", "g": "konspirasi,tamadun", "p": "stanford ruffles RJ wilkinson dan RO winsted ... intervensi historiografi ... artifak asing yang terpencil", "baru": true, "id": "T264-03", "en": {"t": "Stamford Raffles, R.J. Wilkinson and R.O. Winstedt deliberately altered the narrative of Kedah's history through footnotes and editing, belittling the Hikayat Merong Mahawangsa and downplaying Islamic artefacts as the goods of foreign traders."}}], "tt": "7669765511743409425", "en": {"tajuk": "Evidence that destroys the Eurocentric narrative", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 42K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T265", "tarikh": "8 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-08", "tajuk": "Bahasa Nabi Adam ialah bahasa Arab", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7671507902653287697", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7671507902653287697"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Bahasa Arab fusha sudah wujud sebelum Nabi Ibrahim, maka Nabi Nuh dan Nabi Ibrahim bertutur dalam bahasa Arab fusha.", "g": "bahasa,agama", "p": "sebelum itu sudah ada bahasa Arab fushah maksudnya nabi nuh alaihissalam tahu itu bahasa Arab fushah", "baru": true, "id": "T265-01", "en": {"t": "Classical (fusha) Arabic already existed before Prophet Abraham, so Prophet Noah and Prophet Abraham spoke classical Arabic."}}, {"t": "Nama Muhammad SAW tertulis secara semula jadi pada pokok, buah dan badan ikan sebagai bukti bahasa yang dituturkan Tuhan.", "g": "mistik,bahasa", "p": "di pokok-pokok ataupun di badan binatang badan ikan semua tu tulis Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti kajian bahawa corak semula jadi pada buah atau ikan ialah tulisan nama Muhammad; ia lazimnya tafsiran corak (pareidolia).", "awal": true, "id": "T265-02", "en": {"t": "The name Muhammad (peace be upon him) is naturally written on trees, fruits and the bodies of fish as evidence of the language spoken by God.", "n": "There is no research evidence that natural patterns on fruit or fish are writing of the name Muhammad; it is usually an interpretation of patterns (pareidolia)."}}], "tt": "7671507902653287697", "en": {"tajuk": "The language of Prophet Adam is Arabic", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T266", "tarikh": "8 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-08", "tajuk": "Nabi Nuh as hidup dua zaman", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7671637972621577489", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7671637972621577489"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Banjir besar berlaku ketika Nabi Nuh berumur 600 tahun, dan baginda hidup lagi sekitar 350 tahun selepasnya menyaksikan Sam, Ham dan Yafith menjadi raja dan membina penempatan di Mesopotamia (Efrat dan Tigris).", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "banjir besar ketika dia berumur 600 tahun ... sesudah banjir besar 350 tahun dia hidup semula ... anak anaknya yang sanham yafid itu menjadi raja", "baru": true, "id": "T266-01", "en": {"t": "The great flood occurred when Prophet Noah was 600 years old, and he lived about 350 more years afterwards, seeing Shem, Ham and Japheth become kings and build settlements in Mesopotamia (the Euphrates and Tigris)."}}, {"t": "Tulisan sebelum banjir besar musnah akibat banjir, termasuk tulisan Nabi Adam di atas lempung (tablet).", "g": "agama,bahasa", "p": "tulisan sebelum banjir besar itu sudah tiada kerana dimusnahkan oleh banjir besar ... nabi Adam pernah menulis di atas tim", "baru": true, "id": "T266-02", "en": {"t": "Writing from before the great flood was destroyed by the flood, including the writing of Prophet Adam on clay (tablets)."}}, {"t": "George Smith menemui serpihan Gilgamesh (sekitar 3,000 serpihan) di Mesopotamia/Babylon, dibawa ke British Museum; tablet ke-11 mengisahkan banjir besar.", "g": "sains,tamadun", "p": "job smith ini ... mengumpulkan data ... sebanyak 3,000 fragmen ... tablet yang ke-11 itu ada cerita pasal banjir besar", "baru": true, "id": "T266-03", "en": {"t": "George Smith discovered fragments of Gilgamesh (around 3,000 fragments) in Mesopotamia/Babylon, which were brought to the British Museum; the 11th tablet tells of the great flood."}}], "tt": "7671637972621577489", "en": {"tajuk": "Prophet Noah (peace be upon him) lived in two eras", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T267", "tarikh": "9 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-09", "tajuk": "Prasejarah Bangsa Induk Pentas Sunda", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7672094182248336661", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7672094182248336661"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Epik Gilgamesh ialah peristiwa sejarah sebenar tentang banjir besar yang kemudiannya diubah menjadi mitos politeisme.", "g": "agama,tamadun", "p": "epic gilgamesh dan berhujah yang ia sebenarnya peristiwa sejarah benar mengenai banjir besar", "baru": true, "ulang": [{"tt": "7672094182248336661", "p": "epic gilgamesh dan berhujah yang ia sebenarnya peristiwa sejarah benar mengenai banjir besar"}, {"tt": "7672094182248336661", "p": "epic gilgamesh dan berhujah yang ia sebenarnya peristiwa sejarah benar mengenai banjir besar"}], "id": "T267-01", "en": {"t": "The Epic of Gilgamesh is a real historical event about the great flood that was later turned into polytheistic myth."}}], "tt": "7672094182248336661", "en": {"tajuk": "The prehistory of the Mother Race of the Sunda Shelf", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 10K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T268", "tarikh": "11 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-11", "tajuk": "Besi perkataan Melayu dalam al-Quran (Bahagian 10)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7672563195269156117", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7672563195269156117"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Perkataan 'besi' ialah perkataan asal Melayu yang dikaitkan dengan al-Quran (al-Anbiya ayat 80), kerana besi 'diturunkan' di kawasan Alam Melayu.", "g": "bahasa,besi,agama", "p": "perkataan asal itu besi sebab apa ia diturunkan di kawasan kita kemudian orang orang kawasan ini menyebutnya", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Ayat al-Anbiya 80 menyebut 'labus' (pakaian perisai), bukan 'besi'; perkataan Arab bagi besi ialah 'hadid'.", "awal": true, "id": "T268-01", "en": {"t": "The word 'besi' (iron) is an original Malay word linked to the Quran (al-Anbiya verse 80), because iron was 'sent down' in the Malay World region.", "n": "Verse al-Anbiya 80 mentions 'labus' (armour garment), not 'iron'; the Arabic word for iron is 'hadid'."}}, {"t": "Data tulisan Melayu dan buku Jawi di selatan Thailand tidak rosak atau hilang kerana kawasan itu tidak berada di bawah British.", "g": "konspirasi,bahasa", "p": "data data tak dirosakkan tak diambil tak hilang kerana bahagian selatan Thailand tidak di bawah British", "baru": true, "id": "T268-02", "en": {"t": "Malay writing data and Jawi books in southern Thailand were not damaged or lost because the area was not under the British."}}], "tt": "7672563195269156117", "en": {"tajuk": "Besi (iron), a Malay word in the Quran (Part 10)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 14K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T269", "tarikh": "22 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-22", "tajuk": "Kedah pusat tamadun awal di Tanah Melayu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 39 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7676661410864188673", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7676661410864188673"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Besi datang dari langit, bukan dari bumi, manakala emas dan batu permata dalam bumi boleh “beranak” sehingga tidak habis.", "g": "sains,besi", "p": "besi ni dia dia daripada langit dia bukan daripada bumi yang daripada bumi emas batu permata dia boleh beranak", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Emas dan batu permata ialah sumber tak boleh diperbaharui yang terbentuk dalam tempoh geologi berjuta tahun; ia tidak “beranak”, dan bijih besi banyak terdapat dalam kerak bumi.", "awal": true, "id": "T269-01", "en": {"t": "Iron comes from the sky, not from the earth, whereas gold and gemstones in the earth can 'reproduce' so that they never run out.", "n": "Gold and gemstones are non-renewable resources formed over millions of years of geological time; they do not 'reproduce', and iron ore is abundant in the earth's crust."}}], "tt": "7676661410864188673", "en": {"tajuk": "Kedah, centre of early civilisation in the Malay Peninsula", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 39K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T270", "tarikh": "22 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-22", "tajuk": "Sejarah peradaban manusia perlu bersandarkan Quran-sentrik (Bahagian 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 35 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7676735239233867024", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7676735239233867024"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Besi ialah makhluk hidup yang bermutasi dan boleh beranak.", "g": "besi,sains", "p": "besi ni sifat dia makhluk yang bermutasi hmm dia dia boleh beranak", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Besi ialah unsur kimia, bukan makhluk hidup; ia tidak bermutasi atau beranak.", "awal": true, "id": "T270-01", "en": {"t": "Iron is a living thing that mutates and can reproduce.", "n": "Iron is a chemical element, not a living thing; it does not mutate or reproduce."}}, {"t": "Kerajaan Kedah Tua dan tamadun Sungai Batu sezaman dengan Nabi Syuib, Nabi Daud dan Nabi Sulaiman.", "g": "tamadun,agama,besi", "p": "ini pada ketika ini adalah kerajaan Kedah tua tamadun sungai batu", "baru": true, "id": "T270-02", "en": {"t": "The Old Kedah kingdom and the Sungai Batu civilisation were contemporary with Prophet Shuaib, Prophet David and Prophet Solomon."}}], "tt": "7676735239233867024", "en": {"tajuk": "The history of human civilisation must be grounded in a Quran-centric approach (Part 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 35K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T271", "tarikh": "22 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-22", "tajuk": "Sejarah peradaban manusia perlu kefahaman Quran-sentrik (Bahagian 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 42 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7676739967904730369", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7676739967904730369"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Meluha bukan keturunan Sam, Ham atau Yafith kerana mereka hidup sebelum Nabi Nuh, pada zaman Nabi Idris ke atas.", "g": "agama,tamadun", "p": "meluha ni bukan Sam bukan Ham bukan yafit sebab itu kita tak namakan Melayu", "baru": true, "id": "T271-01", "en": {"t": "Meluha is not descended from Shem, Ham or Japheth because they lived before Prophet Noah, in the time of Prophet Idris and earlier."}}, {"t": "Nabi Adam diturunkan di al-Hind (Syarqul Hind), yang bermaksud Nusantara/Alam Melayu, lalu berjalan ke Arabia; Hassan al-Basri menyebut Adam, Hawa, Iblis dan ular turun di tempat berlainan.", "g": "agama,tamadun", "p": "alhin tarif alhin itu ialah syarkul hain syarkul hain tadi mesti kawasan ni Nusantara alam Melayu", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Dalam sumber Arab klasik al-Hind merujuk benua kecil India (dengan Sri Lanka), bukan Nusantara.", "awal": true, "id": "T271-02", "en": {"t": "Prophet Adam was sent down in al-Hind (Syarqul Hind), which means the Nusantara/Malay World, then walked to Arabia; Hassan al-Basri mentions that Adam, Eve, Iblis and the serpent descended in different places.", "n": "In classical Arabic sources, al-Hind refers to the Indian subcontinent (with Sri Lanka), not the Nusantara."}}], "tt": "7676739967904730369", "en": {"tajuk": "The history of human civilisation requires a Quran-centric understanding (Part 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 42K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T272", "tarikh": "22 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-22", "tajuk": "Sejarah peradaban manusia perlu bersandarkan Quran-sentrik (Bahagian 3)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 53 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7676746573841222913", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7676746573841222913"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nabi Adam tidak pulang ke Hind kerana Jibril melarangnya selepas dosanya, walaupun Hawa sakit dan ubatnya herba di sana.", "g": "agama,islam", "p": "Jibril larang kau jangan pergi Adam kawasan hind kau tidak layak", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kisah ini tidak terdapat dalam al-Quran atau hadis sahih.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-01", "en": {"t": "Prophet Adam did not return to Hind because Gabriel forbade him after his sin, even though Eve was ill and the remedy was herbs there.", "n": "This story is not found in the Quran or authentic hadith."}}, {"t": "DNA manusia berusia 86,000 tahun di Laos ialah anak cucu Nabi Adam/Nabi Syis yang berhijrah ke Pentas Sunda; Nabi Syis berkahwin di kawasan ini.", "g": "sains,agama", "p": "sebab kita jumpa anak anak cucu dia 86,000 BC", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti sains yang mengaitkan penemuan manusia purba di Laos dengan Nabi Adam atau Nabi Syis.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-02", "en": {"t": "The 86,000-year-old human DNA in Laos belongs to descendants of Prophet Adam/Prophet Seth who migrated to the Sunda Shelf; Prophet Seth married in this region.", "n": "There is no scientific evidence linking the discovery of ancient humans in Laos to Prophet Adam or Prophet Seth."}}, {"t": "Tulisan Rencong lebih awal daripada tulisan Phoenicia yang baru wujud sekitar 1,200 SM.", "g": "bahasa,tamadun", "p": "tulisan rencong itu lebih awal daripada tulisan foundation", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Aksara Rencong tergolong dalam keluarga aksara Brahmi yang bertarikh jauh lebih kemudian, dan tidak lebih tua daripada abjad Phoenicia.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-03", "en": {"t": "The Rencong script is earlier than the Phoenician script, which only appeared around 1,200 BCE.", "n": "The Rencong script belongs to the Brahmi family of scripts, which dates much later, and is not older than the Phoenician alphabet."}}, {"t": "Batu Bersurat Kedukan Bukit ialah relik yang boleh dibawa, bukan monumen, maka tidak semestinya Srivijaya berlaku di Palembang.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "dia adalah relik yang boleh letak dalam poket je", "baru": true, "id": "T272-04", "en": {"t": "The Kedukan Bukit Inscription is a portable relic, not a monument, so Srivijaya did not necessarily take place in Palembang."}}, {"t": "Orientalis ialah “syarikat Yahudi” yang sengaja mencemarkan sejarah Alam Melayu.", "g": "konspirasi", "p": "mereka ini adalah syarikat Yahudi", "baru": true, "id": "T272-05", "en": {"t": "Orientalists are a 'Jewish company' that deliberately polluted the history of the Malay World."}}, {"t": "Yahudi di Israel hari ini bukan bangsa asal di situ tetapi bangsa Eropah (Khazar), dan ujian DNA dilarang di Israel supaya tidak terbongkar.", "g": "konspirasi,sains", "p": "mereka ini bangsa Eropah sebab itu DNA dilarang di aa di Israel", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Kajian genetik menunjukkan majoriti Yahudi mempunyai nenek moyang Timur Tengah; teori asal-usul Khazar tidak disokong bukti.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-06", "en": {"t": "The Jews in Israel today are not the original people there but a European people (Khazars), and DNA testing is forbidden in Israel so that this is not exposed.", "n": "Genetic studies show that the majority of Jews have Middle Eastern ancestry; the Khazar origin theory is not supported by evidence."}}, {"t": "Anjing hadiah Meluha kepada Raja Sargon ialah anjing berbulu lebat yang hidup di Titiwangsa dan kini sudah pupus.", "g": "sains,tamadun", "p": "dihadiahkan kepada raja sagon raja er Syria", "baru": true, "id": "T272-07", "en": {"t": "The dog that Meluha gave as a gift to King Sargon was a thick-furred dog that lived in Titiwangsa and is now extinct."}}, {"t": "Ziggurat Mesopotamia dibina berdasarkan memori piramid empat segi Gunung Padang, Gelanggi dan Angkor yang dibawa orang Meluha.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "dia ambil memorial gunung padang memori memori aa gelanggi memori Angkor untuk dibawa ke sana", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Angkor dibina antara abad ke-9 hingga ke-13 M, jauh kemudian daripada ziggurat Mesopotamia yang bermula sekitar 2100 SM.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-08", "en": {"t": "Mesopotamian ziggurats were built based on the memory of the four-sided pyramids of Gunung Padang, Gelanggi and Angkor brought by the Meluha people.", "n": "Angkor was built between the 9th and 13th centuries CE, long after the Mesopotamian ziggurats, which began around 2100 BCE."}}, {"t": "Henry Kissinger berkata beliau tidak takut Arab tetapi takut “harimau di timur yang sedang tidur”; penjajah meletakkan pasak mistik di Nusantara supaya harimau itu tidak bangkit.", "g": "konspirasi,mistik", "p": "aku tidak takut aa kepada bangsa Arab tetapi apa yang aku takut ialah suatu suatu bangsa 1 bangsa di timur yang sedang tidur", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada sumber primer yang mengesahkan Henry Kissinger pernah mengeluarkan kenyataan itu.", "awal": true, "id": "T272-09", "en": {"t": "Henry Kissinger said he was not afraid of the Arabs but of 'the sleeping tiger in the east'; the colonialists placed mystical pegs in the Nusantara so that the tiger would not rise.", "n": "No primary source confirms that Henry Kissinger ever made that statement."}}], "tt": "7676746573841222913", "en": {"tajuk": "The history of human civilisation must be grounded in a Quran-centric approach (Part 3)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 53K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T273", "tarikh": "23 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08-23", "tajuk": "Jati diri bangsa Melayu: Srivijaya, Hindu dan Hanif", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 80 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7677254061074287889", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7677254061074287889"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Penemuan Sungai Batu bertarikh 788 SM bermakna Kedah Tua sudah wujud dengan ekonomi dan eksport besi sebelum kelahiran Buddha, maka Kedah Tua tidak beragama Buddha.", "g": "tamadun,agama,besi", "p": "sebelum kemunculan Buddha sudah ada sebuah kerajaan yang hebat di Kedah tua ... sudah tertolak bahawasanya Kedah tua itu mengamalkan agama Buddha", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Buddha dilahirkan sekitar abad ke-5 SM, dan kewujudan tapak lebih awal tidak membuktikan penduduknya tidak pernah menganut Buddha pada zaman kemudian.", "awal": true, "id": "T273-01", "en": {"t": "The Sungai Batu discovery dated to 788 BCE means Old Kedah already existed with an economy and iron exports before the birth of the Buddha, so Old Kedah was not Buddhist.", "n": "The Buddha was born around the 5th century BCE, and the existence of an earlier site does not prove that its inhabitants never adopted Buddhism in later periods."}}, {"t": "Penulis kitab tafsir tidak mempunyai kepentingan politik dan menulis berdasarkan penulisan yang benar, maka sumber tafsir tidak boleh dinafikan.", "g": "islam", "p": "penulis-penulis tafsir ini tidak mempunyai kepentingan politik penulisan mereka berdasarkan penulisan yang yang benar", "baru": true, "id": "T273-02", "en": {"t": "Authors of tafsir (Quranic commentary) works had no political interests and wrote based on truthful writings, so the sources of tafsir cannot be denied."}}, {"t": "Kerajaan Funan sudah wujud sejak 500 Masihi, tarikh yang masih 'baharu' berbanding kajiannya sejak Nabi Adam; Sriwijaya didakwa bermula 670 M.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "dari funan dari Kemboja semenjak daripada 500 lagi 500 Masihi itu masih baharu", "baru": true, "id": "T273-03", "en": {"t": "The Funan kingdom already existed from 500 CE, a date that is still 'new' compared with her study going back to Prophet Adam; Sriwijaya is claimed to have begun in 670 CE."}}], "tt": "7677254061074287889", "en": {"tajuk": "The identity of the Malay people: Srivijaya, Hindu and Hanif", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 80K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "W12", "tarikh": "23–24 Ogos 2026", "sort": "2026-08b", "tajuk": "Kenyataan selepas UIAM umum penamatan perkhidmatan", "platform": "Temu bual TV Pertiwi, kenyataan media", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "FMT, 23 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://www.freemalaysiatoday.com/category/nation/2026/08/23/controversial-lecturer-solehah-to-challenge-termination-by-iium"}, {"l": "Berita Harian, Ogos 2026", "u": "https://www.bharian.com.my/berita/nasional/2026/08/1605924/dr-solehah-yaacob-akan-cabar-pemecatan-oleh-uiam"}, {"l": "Focus Malaysia, 24 Ogos 2026", "u": "https://focusmalaysia.my/james-chin-hails-prof-solehahs-contract-termination-but-rightists-defend-her-academic-wisdom/"}], "d": [{"t": "Dipecat kerana tidak hadir satu pun mesyuarat inkuiri isu kapal Rom: dua kali ada surat masuk wad dan cuti sakit, kali ketiga ada program berbayar yang tak boleh dibatalkan.", "g": "diri", "id": "W12-01", "en": {"t": "Dismissed for not attending a single inquiry meeting on the Roman ship issue: twice she had hospital admission letters and sick leave, the third time she had a paid programme that could not be cancelled."}}, {"t": "“Saya dipecat dalam tempoh 24 jam dan tidak dibenarkan buat rayuan” — sehari selepas menerima anugerah MyRA KPT.", "g": "diri", "id": "W12-02", "en": {"t": "“I was dismissed within 24 hours and not allowed to appeal” — a day after receiving the Higher Education Ministry's MyRA award."}}, {"t": "Menolak tawaran pampasan gaji enam bulan; akan membawa kes ke Mahkamah Perusahaan.", "g": "diri", "id": "W12-03", "en": {"t": "Rejected an offer of six months' salary as compensation; will take the case to the Industrial Court."}}], "nota": "", "en": {"tajuk": "Statements after IIUM announced the termination of her employment", "platform": "TV Pertiwi interview, media statements", "tarikh": "23–24 Aug 2026"}}, {"id": "W13", "tarikh": "6 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09", "tajuk": "Video: warisan Hindu-Buddha “propaganda sistematik”; Ibrahim orang Melayu; Musa ke Gunung Jerai", "platform": "Video media sosial / YouTube", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "Asia News Network (The Straits Times), 28 Sep 2026", "u": "https://asianews.network/?p=304027"}, {"l": "Malay Mail, 28 Sep 2026", "u": "https://www.malaymail.com/news/malaysia/2026/09/28/from-mat-kilau-to-flying-malays-how-communal-anxieties-fuel-alternative-history-publishers/236803"}], "d": [{"t": "Masa lalu Hindu-Buddha ialah “systematic propaganda from the 1800s” oleh tokoh Barat termasuk Stamford Raffles.", "g": "konspirasi", "id": "W13-01", "en": {"t": "The Hindu-Buddhist past is “systematic propaganda from the 1800s” by Western figures including Stamford Raffles."}}, {"t": "Relik Hindu-Buddha yang dijumpai “diletakkan baru-baru ini”.", "g": "konspirasi,tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Tapak seperti Bukit Choras dan Lembah Bujang digali secara stratigrafi dan bertarikh.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7688714678704295174", "p": "dia orang buat patung patung letak dekat Gunung Jerai nak claim"}], "id": "W13-02", "fatal": 16, "sang": [4], "ruj": [{"l": "Lembah Bujang (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bujang_Valley", "le": "Bujang Valley (Wikipedia)"}, {"l": "Asia News Network / The Straits Times, 28 Sep 2026", "u": "https://asianews.network/?p=304027"}], "en": {"t": "Hindu-Buddhist relics that have been found were “placed there recently”.", "n": "Sites such as Bukit Choras and the Bujang Valley were excavated stratigraphically and dated."}}, {"t": "Nabi Ibrahim seorang Melayu.", "g": "agama", "id": "W13-03", "fatal": 13, "ruj": [{"l": "Asia News Network / The Straits Times, 28 Sep 2026", "u": "https://asianews.network/?p=304027"}], "en": {"t": "Prophet Abraham was a Malay."}}, {"t": "Nabi Musa pernah ke Gunung Jerai, Kedah.", "g": "agama", "id": "W13-04", "fatal": 13, "ruj": [{"l": "Asia News Network / The Straits Times, 28 Sep 2026", "u": "https://asianews.network/?p=304027"}], "en": {"t": "Prophet Moses once went to Gunung Jerai, Kedah."}}], "nota": "", "en": {"tajuk": "Video: Hindu-Buddhist heritage as “systematic propaganda”; Abraham a Malay; Moses at Gunung Jerai", "platform": "Social media video / YouTube", "tarikh": "6 Sep 2026"}}, {"id": "T274", "tarikh": "1 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-01", "tajuk": "Peradaban Melayu mesti dikaitkan dengan nabi-nabi", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7680393576387251472", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7680393576387251472"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nabi Zakaria berketurunan Nabi Sulaiman dan Imran (ayah Maryam) ialah biras Zakaria; Maryam dibawa ke Mesir dan Nabi Isa membesar di sana sehingga umur 12 tahun (atau 7 tahun) dan fasih pelbagai bahasa.", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "Zakaria ini susur galurnya daripada nabi Sulaiman Isa membesar di Mesir ada setengah riwayat kata umur 12 tahun", "baru": true, "id": "T274-01", "en": {"t": "Prophet Zechariah was a descendant of Prophet Solomon and Imran (Mary's father) was Zechariah's brother-in-law; Mary was taken to Egypt and Prophet Jesus grew up there until the age of 12 (or 7) and was fluent in many languages."}}], "tt": "7680393576387251472", "en": {"tajuk": "Malay civilisation must be linked to the prophets", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T275", "tarikh": "1 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-01", "tajuk": "Kena tukar maklumat kurang tepat dalam buku teks", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 79 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7680509545772371217", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7680509545772371217"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Dalam nahu Arab, hamzah istifham yang digunakan malaikat dalam al-Baqarah:30 bermaksud makhluk itu sedang dijadikan, manakala 'hal' bermaksud sudah lama wujud.", "g": "bahasa,islam", "p": "dalam kaedah nahu kalau guna Hamzah bermakna makhluk itu sedang jadi kalau diguna hal makhluk itu sudah sudah dijadikan dah wujud lama", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Hamzah dan 'hal' ialah dua partikel soal (istifham) dalam bahasa Arab; kedua-duanya tidak menentukan sama ada perbuatan sedang atau sudah berlaku.", "awal": true, "id": "T275-01", "en": {"t": "In Arabic grammar, the interrogative hamzah (hamzat al-istifham) used by the angels in al-Baqarah:30 means the creature is being created, whereas 'hal' means it has long existed.", "n": "Hamzah and 'hal' are two interrogative (istifham) particles in Arabic; neither determines whether an action is ongoing or already done."}}], "tt": "7680509545772371217", "en": {"tajuk": "Inaccurate information in textbooks must be changed", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 79K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T276", "tarikh": "2 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-02", "tajuk": "Misteri penipuan kapal Rom", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 79 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7680760719733820692", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7680760719733820692"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal Melayu ialah kapal maritim terawal yang dibina di lautan dan dibina tanpa sebatang paku.", "g": "maritim,tamadun", "p": "kapal Melayulah kapal maryting yang hebat melayar dan kapal yang terawal yang telah dibina di atas lautan", "baru": true, "id": "T276-01", "en": {"t": "The Malay ship is the earliest maritime ship built on the ocean and was built without a single nail."}}], "tt": "7680760719733820692", "en": {"tajuk": "The mystery of the Roman ship deception", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 79K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T277", "tarikh": "3 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-03", "tajuk": "Sungai Batu, syiling Kedah dan paras air purba", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 21 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7681425975069936897", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7681425975069936897"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Sami Cina I-Tsing singgah di Kedah kerana tidak mahu ke India yang pernah merompaknya, sedangkan raja Kedah menjamin keselamatan pedagang.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "dia nak pergi ke India dia singgah ke Kedah dia kata aku tidak suka pergi ke India karena aku pernah dirompak", "baru": true, "id": "T277-01", "en": {"t": "The Chinese monk I-Tsing stopped in Kedah because he did not want to go to India, where he had once been robbed, whereas the king of Kedah guaranteed the safety of traders."}}, {"t": "Kubur anak Muaz bin Jabal ditemui di Barus, Sumatera.", "g": "islam,tokoh", "p": "kubur anak Muaz bin Jabal dekat barus", "baru": true, "id": "T277-02", "en": {"t": "The grave of the son of Muadh bin Jabal was found in Barus, Sumatra."}}, {"t": "Syiling Abbasiyah dan Umawiyah yang dijumpai di Sumatera adalah asli, bukan palsu, kerana orang Melayu tidak pandai menipu.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "bertimbung duit siling kerjaan abbasi dan Umawi", "baru": true, "id": "T277-03", "en": {"t": "The Abbasid and Umayyad coins found in Sumatra are genuine, not fake, because the Malays are not good at cheating."}}], "tt": "7681425975069936897", "en": {"tajuk": "Sungai Batu, Kedah coins and ancient sea levels", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 21K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T278", "tarikh": "6 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-06", "tajuk": "Melayu bangsa tua dan agama tauhid", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 12 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7682214538174795009", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7682214538174795009"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Orientalis masih berpegang kepada dendam Perang Salib yang belum reda, lalu menutup tulisan Rencong.", "g": "konspirasi", "p": "mereka masih berpegang kepada perang salih itu dendam perang salih itu belum lagi reda", "baru": true, "id": "T278-01", "en": {"t": "Orientalists still hold on to a grudge from the Crusades that has not subsided, and so they have covered up the Rencong script."}}], "tt": "7682214538174795009", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malays, an ancient people and the monotheistic religion", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 12K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T279", "tarikh": "11 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-11", "tajuk": "Pulau Besar dikenali sebagai Pulau Seribu Wali", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 119 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7684125602458225937", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7684125602458225937"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Sultan Arifin Syekh Ismail yang dimakamkan di Pulau Besar ialah keturunan ke-18 Rasulullah, dilahirkan 867 Hijrah (1463 M) dan tiba di pulau itu bersama 16 sahabat.", "g": "tokoh,islam", "p": "beliau adalah keturunan yang ke-18 rasulullah shallallahu alaihi wasallam", "baru": true, "id": "T279-01", "en": {"t": "Sultan Arifin Syekh Ismail, buried on Pulau Besar, was the 18th-generation descendant of the Prophet, born in 867 Hijri (1463 CE), and arrived on the island with 16 companions."}}, {"t": "Antara murid Sultan Arifin Syekh Ismail ialah Sunan Bonang dan Raden Paku (Sunan Giri).", "g": "tokoh,islam", "p": "antara murid beliau yang sangat masyhur ialah raden maktun Ibrahim ditarik sebagai sunan bonang serta raden paku", "baru": true, "id": "T279-02", "en": {"t": "Among the students of Sultan Arifin Syekh Ismail were Sunan Bonang and Raden Paku (Sunan Giri)."}}], "tt": "7684125602458225937", "en": {"tajuk": "Pulau Besar known as the Island of a Thousand Saints", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 119K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T04", "tarikh": "12 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-12", "tajuk": "“Melaka bukan sekadar nama”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 535 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7684468971977903361", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7684468971977903361"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal terbang mengelak laluan atas laut kerana angin kuat, dan memilih kawasan darat atau berbukit yang lebih selamat.", "g": "sains", "v": "Salah", "n": "Penerbangan antara benua lazim merentas lautan (laluan trans-Pasifik dan trans-Atlantik).", "ulang": [{"tt": "7684950340898393362", "p": "kapal terbang pun dia takkan lalu kawasan laut kalau boleh kalau ada kawasan darat dia akan lalu kawasan darat"}], "id": "T04-01", "en": {"t": "Aeroplanes avoid routes over the sea because of strong winds, choosing land or hilly areas that are safer.", "n": "Intercontinental flights routinely cross oceans (trans-Pacific and trans-Atlantic routes)."}}, {"t": "Imam Syafie berkata sesiapa yang menguasai istilah dapat membongkar sejarah dunia.", "g": "agama", "v": "Belum dapat disahkan", "ulang": [{"tt": "7699362753651264776", "p": "dia dapat membongkar sejarah dunia yang benar dan ini disebut oleh Syafi'i"}, {"tt": "7684950340898393362", "p": "sesiapa yang menguasai istilah dia dapat membongkar sejarah dunia"}], "id": "T04-02", "en": {"t": "Imam al-Shafi'i said whoever masters terminology can uncover world history."}}, {"t": "Melaka daripada perkataan Arab “malka”, tempat pertemuan — pintu gerbang besar ke dunia.", "g": "bahasa", "ulang": [{"tt": "7684950340898393362", "p": "Malaka ni perkataan Arab malka dia tempat pertemuan"}], "id": "T04-03", "sang": [25], "en": {"t": "Melaka comes from the Arabic word “malka”, a meeting place — the great gateway to the world."}}], "tt": "7684468971977903361", "en": {"tajuk": "“Melaka is not just a name”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 535K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T10", "tarikh": "13 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-13", "tajuk": "Layar tanjak: rahsia layar Melayu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 228 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7684839030013447440", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7684839030013447440"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal Rom berlayar empat segi tak mampu belayar jauh; Rom sampai ke Kedah dengan mengikut layar tanjak Melayu.", "g": "maritim", "v": "Salah", "n": "Kapal dagang Rom berlayar segi empat belayar ke India (Muziris) dengan angin monsun sejak abad pertama Masihi.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7680870444156685569", "p": "layar mereka 4 segi tak boleh keluar selain daripada yang mediteranium dekat saja"}], "id": "T10-01", "sang": [29], "en": {"t": "Roman ships with square sails could not sail far; the Romans reached Kedah by following the Malay tanjak sail.", "n": "Roman square-rigged merchant ships sailed to India (Muziris) with the monsoon winds from the 1st century CE."}}, {"t": "Manik Rom di Kedah dan cengkih di Rom membuktikan orang Rom sampai ke Kedah.", "g": "maritim", "v": "Sebahagian betul", "n": "Barangan boleh berpindah melalui rantaian pedagang perantara tanpa orang Rom sendiri sampai.", "id": "T10-02", "en": {"t": "Roman beads in Kedah and cloves in Rome prove the Romans reached Kedah.", "n": "Goods can move through chains of intermediary traders without the Romans themselves arriving."}}], "tt": "7684839030013447440", "en": {"tajuk": "The tanjak sail: secret of the Malay sail", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 228K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T280", "tarikh": "13 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-13", "tajuk": "Hadis Keturah dan anak-anaknya di Alam Melayu", "platform": "TikTok @prof.solehah · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7684913036804525319", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@prof.solehah/video/7684913036804525319"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Hadis dalam Sunan Abu Dawud (no. 4306, bab al-Malahim) menyebut 'Bani Qanturah' (anak Keturah) pada akhir zaman yang berpecah kepada tiga kumpulan, termasuk pengembala di padang (Mongol), orang di Sungai Kuning (China) dan kumpulan yang membawa anak ke ladang (Melayu).", "g": "islam,tokoh,agama", "p": "hadis yang 4,306 cerita pasal katurah ... bano katurak ... salasa firaq ... sungai kuning di Cina ... mereka letak anak mereka belakang mereka", "baru": true, "id": "T280-01", "en": {"t": "A hadith in Sunan Abu Dawud (no. 4306, chapter al-Malahim) mentions the 'Bani Qanturah' (children of Keturah) at the end of time who split into three groups, including shepherds in the steppe (Mongols), people at the Yellow River (China) and a group who carry their children to the fields (Malays)."}}], "tt": "7684913036804525319", "en": {"tajuk": "The hadith of Keturah and her children in the Malay World", "platform": "TikTok @prof.solehah · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T281", "tarikh": "16 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-16", "tajuk": "Batu Bersurat Terengganu bukti Islam sejak 800 M", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 9 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7686070521410178320", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7686070521410178320"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Tulisan Batu Bersurat Terengganu (1303) sudah matang berdasarkan paleografi, maka Islam sudah bertapak sejak sekitar 800 M.", "g": "islam,bahasa", "p": "tulisan tu dah matang maknanya tok nenek orang yang tulis batu bersugat tu dah tahun nulis lamalah tulisan jawi", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Batu Bersurat Terengganu bertarikh sekitar 1303 M; tiada kajian paleografi yang menyimpulkan Islam bertapak di sini sejak 800 M berdasarkan batu itu.", "awal": true, "id": "T281-01", "en": {"t": "The writing on the Terengganu Inscription Stone (1303) was already mature based on palaeography, so Islam was already established from around 800 CE.", "n": "The Terengganu Inscription Stone is dated to around 1303 CE; no palaeographic study concludes that Islam was established here since 800 CE on the basis of the stone."}}], "tt": "7686070521410178320", "en": {"tajuk": "The Terengganu Inscription Stone as proof of Islam since 800 CE", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 9K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T08", "tarikh": "19 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-19", "tajuk": "Duit syiling dan Batu Bersurat Terengganu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 278 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7687092680311966983", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7687092680311966983"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Tulisan pada duit syiling yang tiada alif-lam membuktikan ia lebih awal daripada Batu Bersurat Terengganu (1303), maka Islam sudah 300–400 tahun di sini sebelumnya.", "g": "islam,bahasa", "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Ketiadaan alif-lam bukan kaedah pentarikhan yang diterima; Batu Bersurat Terengganu sendiri bertarikh antara 1303–1387.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7602933328890809620", "p": "tok nenek orang Melayu ni Islamnya dah lebih 300 atau 8 400 tahun ke belakang"}, {"tt": "7607010163731500308", "p": "7 3 6 di sudut evolusi simbol dia sudah evolusi simbol tulisannya dia skated dia tidak bersambung"}, {"tt": "7546031446432025864", "p": "tok nenek orang Melayu ni Islamnya dah lebih 300 atau 8 400 tahun ke belakang"}, {"tt": "7681425975069936897", "p": "kita boleh katakan tok nenek orang Melayu ni Islamnya dah lebih 300 atau 8 400 tahun ke belakang"}], "id": "T08-01", "en": {"t": "The lack of alif-lam in the writing on coins proves they predate the Terengganu Inscription Stone (1303), so Islam was here 300–400 years before that.", "n": "The absence of alif-lam is not an accepted dating method; the Terengganu Inscription Stone itself is dated to between 1303 and 1387."}}], "tt": "7687092680311966983", "en": {"tajuk": "Coins and the Terengganu Inscription Stone", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 278K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T282", "tarikh": "21 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-21", "tajuk": "Terjajah Melayu dan Bani Israel selama 400 tahun", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 12 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7687882245985684752", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7687882245985684752"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Yahudi bukan nasab atau keturunan tetapi ideologi; Quran tidak menyebut Yahudi sebagai keturunan, dan menukar nasab nabi-nabi menjadi Yahudi ialah langkah pertama membengkokkan sejarah dunia.", "g": "agama,konspirasi,tokoh", "p": "Yahudi tu bukannya keturunan Yahudi tu ideologi ... memalsukan sejarah nasab nabi nabi", "baru": true, "id": "T282-01", "en": {"t": "Jewishness is not lineage or descent but an ideology; the Quran does not describe Jews as a lineage, and changing the lineage of the prophets into Jews was the first step in bending world history."}}, {"t": "Pak Tok Ku Paloh pernah membuat ribut untuk menghalang British dan Belanda menyerang Terengganu, sebab itu Terengganu lewat dijajah; Rusia meminjam manuskrip Baba Lutfi untuk membuat ribut.", "g": "mistik,tokoh", "p": "tok aku palu ... dia buat ribut jadi British kata aku tak usah ... Rusia telepon ke baba Lutfi kata nak pinjam manuskrip", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti sejarah bahawa ribut dicipta secara ghaib untuk menghalang serangan British atau bahawa Rusia meminjam manuskrip untuk tujuan itu.", "awal": true, "id": "T282-02", "en": {"t": "Pak Tok Ku Paloh once made a storm to stop the British and Dutch from attacking Terengganu, which is why Terengganu was colonised late; Russia borrowed Baba Lutfi's manuscript to make storms.", "n": "There is no historical evidence that storms were supernaturally created to prevent British or Dutch attacks or that Russia borrowed manuscripts for that purpose."}}], "tt": "7687882245985684752", "en": {"tajuk": "The colonised Malays and the Bani Israel for 400 years", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 12K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T283", "tarikh": "22 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-22", "tajuk": "Sejarah diubah melalui istilah", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 17 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7688258448265497857", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7688258448265497857"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Istilah 'Austronesia' hanya wujud sekitar 1899; sebelum itu bangsa ini tidak dinamakan begitu.", "g": "bahasa,konspirasi", "p": "astarisia hanya wujud tarif itu hanya wujud kurang dari ke 19 18 99", "baru": true, "id": "T283-01", "en": {"t": "The term 'Austronesian' only came into existence around 1899; before that this race was not named so."}}, {"t": "Nama raja 'Isyanawarman' dalam catatan Cina sebenarnya ialah 'Hisyam', ditulis mengikut bunyi (sound).", "g": "bahasa,tokoh", "p": "isana warman tu sebenar Hisyam", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Isanavarman ialah nama bergelar Sanskrit (bermaksud pelindung Isana/Siva) yang digunakan raja Khmer dan Champa, bukan nama Arab Hisyam.", "awal": true, "id": "T283-02", "en": {"t": "The king's name 'Isyanawarman' in Chinese records is actually 'Hisyam', written according to sound.", "n": "Isanavarman is a Sanskrit regnal name (meaning protector of Isana/Shiva) used by Khmer and Champa kings, not the Arabic name Hisham."}}, {"t": "Puteri Dewi Adruja ialah Siti Zubaidah, nama sebenar yang diubah dalam tulisan.", "g": "bahasa,tokoh", "p": "Dewi durja ke apa dia panggil kepada Siti Zubaidah Siti Zubaidah pun tak tahu nama dia Dewi durja", "baru": true, "id": "T283-03", "en": {"t": "Princess Dewi Adruja is Siti Zubaidah, the real name that was altered in the writings."}}], "tt": "7688258448265497857", "en": {"tajuk": "History altered through terminology", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 17K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T284", "tarikh": "23 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-23", "tajuk": "Gerakan cipta naratif bahawa agama tok nenek Melayu Hindu-Buddha", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 28 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7688714678704295174", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7688714678704295174"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Diari seorang pegawai kolonial Belanda bertarikh 1934 mengarahkan bangunan lama yang menyerupai candi terus diisytihar Hindu-Buddha untuk menjauhkan Melayu daripada Arab, Nabi Muhammad dan khilafah.", "g": "konspirasi,agama", "p": "pada 1934 ada terjumpa dalam diary seorang colonial Belanda ditulis dia kata sekiranya kita berjumpa bangunan bangunan lama", "baru": true, "id": "T284-01", "en": {"t": "The diary of a Dutch colonial official dated 1934 instructs that old buildings resembling temples be declared Hindu-Buddhist outright, to distance the Malays from the Arabs, Prophet Muhammad and the caliphate."}}, {"t": "Dua jilid arkib di Turki mengandungi surat raja-raja Alam Melayu (termasuk Sultan Ahmad Tajuddin Kedah, Johor dan Bengkulu) kepada khalifah Uthmaniyah sejak awal abad ke-18.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "kandungan surat menyurat daripada raja raja di alam Melayu kepada khalifah khalifah di di Turki", "baru": true, "id": "T284-02", "en": {"t": "Two volumes of archives in Turkey contain letters from Malay World rulers (including Sultan Ahmad Tajuddin of Kedah, Johor and Bengkulu) to the Ottoman caliph since the early 18th century."}}], "tt": "7688714678704295174", "en": {"tajuk": "The movement to create a narrative that the Malay ancestors' religion was Hindu-Buddhist", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 28K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T285", "tarikh": "24 Sep 2026", "sort": "2026-09-24", "tajuk": "Hebat maritim perkapalan bangsa Melayu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 7 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7689101675826580737", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7689101675826580737"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Layar empat segi kapal Rom hanya berkesan jika angin dari belakang, manakala layar segitiga (cakar ketam) Austronesia boleh belayar menentang angin.", "g": "maritim,sains", "p": "layar 4 segi kapal Rom ada 1 kelemahan yang sangat kritikal iaitu ia cuma berkesan kalau angin tiup dari arah belakang", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Kapal layar empat segi boleh belayar kira-kira 60-80 darjah daripada arah angin, walaupun kurang cekap berbanding layar segi tiga.", "awal": true, "id": "T285-01", "en": {"t": "The square sails of Roman ships were only effective with a following wind, whereas the Austronesian triangular (crab-claw) sail could sail against the wind.", "n": "Square-rigged ships can sail roughly 60-80 degrees off the wind direction, although less efficiently than triangular sails."}}, {"t": "Layar cakar ketam Austronesia diadaptasi menjadi layar Arab dan seterusnya melahirkan layar Latin Mediterranean pada abad ke-6 hingga ke-7 Masihi.", "g": "maritim,tamadun", "p": "diadaptasi jadi layar Arab yang mana kemudiannya lahirkan layar Latin mediteranian yang kekal ikonik", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Layar latin sudah terakam di Mediterranean sejak abad ke-2 Masihi dan tiada bukti jelas ia berasal daripada layar Austronesia.", "awal": true, "id": "T285-02", "en": {"t": "The Austronesian crab-claw sail was adapted into the Arab sail and subsequently gave rise to the Mediterranean lateen sail in the 6th to 7th centuries CE.", "n": "The lateen sail is already recorded in the Mediterranean from the 2nd century CE, and there is no clear evidence that it originated from the Austronesian sail."}}, {"t": "Kapal Austronesia dibina tanpa paku besi, menggunakan ikatan tali dan pasak yang lebih fleksibel dan tidak pecah dihentam ombak.", "g": "maritim,sains", "p": "dorang buat tanpa guna paku besi langsung jurutera austronisia perkenalkan 1 teknik pembinaan baharu", "baru": true, "id": "T285-03", "en": {"t": "Austronesian ships were built without iron nails, using lashing with rope and wooden pegs, which were more flexible and did not break when struck by waves."}}], "tt": "7689101675826580737", "en": {"tajuk": "The maritime and shipbuilding greatness of the Malay people", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 7K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "S11", "tarikh": "2026 (Muktamar PAS ke-72)", "sort": "2026-09b", "tajuk": "Podcast Dari Jalan Pahang (Harakah) — sempena Muktamar PAS di Putik, Kelantan", "platform": "Facebook video", "links": [{"l": "FB video 1EpBc4XgwK", "u": "https://www.facebook.com/share/v/1EpBc4XgwK/"}], "nota": "", "d": [{"t": "Timeline sejarah Melayu sengaja “dikerat” supaya Melayu nampak bangsa baru.", "g": "konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "mereka menutupnya dengan keratkan time line kita"}], "id": "S11-01", "en": {"t": "The timeline of Malay history was deliberately “cut” so the Malays look like a new race."}}, {"t": "Gambaran nenek moyang Melayu beragama Hindu-Buddha ialah “propaganda sistematik”, hanya sejak 1800.", "g": "konspirasi", "v": "Salah", "n": "Inskripsi bertarikh seperti Kedukan Bukit (683 M) dan monumen seperti Borobudur (abad ke-9) membuktikan kewujudan Hindu-Buddha di Nusantara berabad sebelum 1800.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "propaganda yang mengatakan kita Melayu budha hindu ini hanyalah nenek tok nenek kita hanyalah 1801 propaganda yang sistematik"}, {"tt": "7688714678704295174", "p": "usaha untuk aa membudahhindukan bangsa Melayu ini aa bermula 1,800 ke atas baru je"}, {"tt": "7669765511743409425", "p": "teori India raya matlamatnya adalah untuk menonjolkan dominasi budaya Hindu Buddha secara eksklusif"}], "awal": true, "id": "S11-02", "en": {"t": "The portrayal of Malay ancestors as Hindu-Buddhist is “systematic propaganda”, only since 1800.", "n": "Dated inscriptions such as Kedukan Bukit (683 CE) and monuments such as Borobudur (9th century) prove the presence of Hindu-Buddhism in the Nusantara centuries before 1800."}}, {"t": "Dipecat UIAM hanya kerana kenyataan Rom belajar kapal; keputusan “tidak matang”; tidak diberi peluang membela diri.", "g": "diri", "id": "S11-03", "en": {"t": "Dismissed by IIUM solely over the Rome-learned-shipbuilding statement; the decision was “immature”; she was not given a chance to defend herself."}}, {"t": "Melayu bangsa tua dengan tamadun besar yang hilang; Rom lebih lewat; bangsa Eropah “bangsa baru”.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "ingat ya bangsa Eropa ini bangsa baru tamadon mereka baru oke paham ya"}], "id": "S11-04", "en": {"t": "The Malays are an old race with a great lost civilisation; Rome came later; Europeans are a “new race”."}}, {"t": "Beliau mengkaji “dari atas” (sumber bersih), bukan “dari bawah” yang ada “virus ideas”.", "g": "konspirasi", "id": "S11-05", "en": {"t": "She studies “from above” (clean sources), not “from below”, which carries “virus ideas”."}}, {"t": "“Bangsa Induk Pentas Sunda” muncul sebelum zaman Nabi Nuh (buku baharu dalam pemurnian).", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "bangsa induk peta sunda mereka ini muncul sebelum zaman nabi nuh"}], "id": "S11-06", "sang": [15], "en": {"t": "The “Mother Race of Sundaland” emerged before Noah's time (a new book being finalised)."}}, {"t": "James Low dan sarjana kolonial melabel struktur Lembah Bujang sebagai “candi” untuk membentuk persepsi Hindu-Buddha.", "g": "konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "terus dia akan dia akan mengklaim dia orang buat itu adalah candi"}], "id": "S11-07", "sang": [15, 22, 26], "en": {"t": "James Low and colonial scholars labelled the Bujang Valley structures “candi” (temples) to shape a Hindu-Buddhist perception."}}, {"t": "Phoenicia (1200 SM, DNA orang Lubnan) kawan baik orang Melayu; Melayu dan Phoenicia berhubung hingga zaman Nabi Sulaiman — “ada dalam catatan Classical Studies”.", "g": "maritim", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "foundation 1200 sebelum masihi orang foundation ini ialah sufi ialah DNA ni ialah DNA orang lubenan sekarang"}], "id": "S11-08", "en": {"t": "The Phoenicians (1200 BCE, the DNA of the Lebanese) were good friends of the Malays; the Malays and Phoenicians were in contact until Prophet Solomon's time — “it is in Classical Studies records”."}}, {"t": "Negara tidak dedahkan bahawa nabi-nabi pernah datang ke Alam Melayu kerana “takut terbongkar”.", "g": "konspirasi,agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "negara kita tidak dedahkan info itu kenapa tidak didahkan sebab takut terbongkar"}], "id": "S11-09", "en": {"t": "The country does not reveal that prophets came to the Malay World because it is “afraid of being exposed”."}}, {"t": "“Melayu bermula di Jambi” ialah propaganda; Melayu itu “proto” (umum) dan suku-suku di bawahnya.", "g": "bahasa", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "mereka mengatakan Melayu itu hanya bermula di jambi propaganda"}], "id": "S11-10", "en": {"t": "“The Malays began in Jambi” is propaganda; Malay is the “proto” (general) group with tribes beneath it."}}, {"t": "Dialek Cham berusia 2,000 tahun (Thurgood) bermakna masyarakat Melayu jauh lebih tua.", "g": "bahasa", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "delete cham itu sudah ada 2000 tahun yang silam"}, {"tt": "7232719840706972929", "p": "apabila pedagang dan berlauk yang berbahasa astronisia adalah orang yang akan menjadi orang orang cam"}], "id": "S11-11", "en": {"t": "A 2,000-year-old Cham dialect (Thurgood) means Malay society is much older."}}, {"t": "G.B. Walker (The Angkor Empire): orang Angkor sudah ada akidah sendiri sebelum Aryan dan Dravidian; akidah asal itu tauhid.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "rupanya masyarakat di angkor ini sudah ada pegangan sudah ada akidah akidah tersendiri yang mana lebih lama lagi"}, {"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "kemer itu merupakan Melayu ... sudah ada the system of religius long ago before the influence of India and Buddhist"}, {"tt": "7625350763258137863", "p": "sebelum datangnya pengaruh dravidian dan arian sudah ada religi system yang panjang ... di angkor"}], "v": "Salah", "n": "Orang Khmer ialah penutur bahasa Austroasiatik (Mon-Khmer), bukan Austronesia/Melayu.", "awal": true, "id": "S11-12", "en": {"t": "G.B. Walker (The Angkor Empire): the people of Angkor had their own creed before the Aryans and Dravidians; that original creed was monotheism.", "n": "The Khmer are speakers of an Austroasiatic (Mon-Khmer) language, not Austronesian/Malay."}}, {"t": "Tiada patung di Alam Melayu kerana ia “bumi tauhid”; “peradaban Melayu, peradaban tauhid”.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "kenapa kita tidak mempunyai apa patung-patung dan sebagainya sebab di bumi ini bumi tauhid"}, {"tt": "7708066243969879317", "p": "bangsa di atas petah Sunda mereka itu adalah bertauhi"}], "id": "S11-13", "en": {"t": "There are no statues in the Malay World because it is a “land of tawhid”; “Malay civilisation is a civilisation of tawhid”."}}, {"t": "Al-Quran tidak menyebut kaum Nabi Nuh “kafir”, hanya “fasik”.", "g": "agama", "v": "Salah", "n": "Doa Nuh dalam Surah Nuh 71:26 menyebut mereka “al-kāfirīn”.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "kaum nabi nuh tidak disebut kafir kaum nabi nuh disebut fasik"}], "id": "S11-14", "fatal": 36, "ruj": [{"l": "Surah Nuh 71:26", "u": "https://quran.com/71/26"}], "en": {"t": "The Quran does not call Noah's people “kafir” (disbelievers), only “fasiq” (transgressors).", "n": "Noah's prayer in Surah Nuh 71:26 calls them “al-kāfirīn”."}}, {"t": "Pentas Sunda tenggelam dua kali: kira-kira 10,000 tahun lalu (akhir Zaman Ais) dan semasa banjir Nuh.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "tenggelam peta sunda sekitar 10.000 10.000 tahun yang silam akibat daripada pecahan ice age"}, {"tt": "7651651641271274770", "p": "tenggelamnya sundalan itu ... bandar sebenarnya di sundalan tu taman dunia ini disebut oleh ... santos"}, {"tt": "7696921654064205072", "p": "dulu daratan sebelum tenggelamnya yang dryers itu sebelum 10,000 tahun yang silam padang sawana boleh berjalan kaki Sumatera ke bonyo"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "banjir besar ni second wave dah nampak tak yang 10,000 ni tenggelamnya sundalan"}, {"tt": "7708066711517302037", "p": "peta sunda ini sebelum ... 25.000 tahun yang silam merupakan padang rumput sawana ... tenggelam sekitar 12.000 sehingga 10.000 bci ... ice mencair"}], "id": "S11-15", "sang": [15], "en": {"t": "Sundaland sank twice: about 10,000 years ago (end of the Ice Age) and during Noah's flood."}}, {"t": "Tiada tamadun yang lebih awal daripada Pentas Sunda; “Tartaria baru”.", "g": "tamadun", "id": "S11-16", "sang": [15], "en": {"t": "No civilisation is older than Sundaland; “Tartaria is new”."}}, {"t": "Jericho berusia 9,000 tahun bermakna mesti ada tamadun lebih tua — iaitu Pentas Sunda.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "kota Jericho itu bertarikh 9000 mana sudah ada orang tinggal di situ walaupun catatan orientalis mesopotamia hanya bermula 7000 atau 8000"}, {"tt": "7708067144998604052", "p": "kota Jericho itu berharga 9000 BCE ... terdapat hubungan Mesopotamia dengan petah sundar"}], "id": "S11-17", "en": {"t": "Jericho being 9,000 years old means there must have been an older civilisation — namely Sundaland."}}, {"t": "Gunung Padang di Cianjur ialah piramid buatan manusia berusia 25,000 tahun, ada “simen” antara lapisan.", "g": "tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Kertas 2023 ditarik balik kerana ralat pentarikhan; tiada bukti buatan manusia.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "gunung padang tuh 25.020 5000 tahun gunung padang ada piramid"}, {"tt": "7693544762112101640", "p": "kita ada 25,000 25 ribu tahun usia gunung padang apa ada kat gunung padang tu dia ada piramid"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "gunung padang ini dalam usia 25,000 walaupun ada jenuh yang tak setuju"}, {"tt": "7708066711517302037", "p": "gunung padang yang bertarif 25.000 ... piramid ... hasil daripada letusan gunung berapi ... terdapat siming daripada satu pundak ke pundak yang lain"}], "id": "S11-18", "fatal": 7, "ruj": [{"l": "Gunung Padang & kertas yang ditarik balik (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunung_Padang", "le": "Gunung Padang & the retracted paper (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Gunung Padang in Cianjur is a 25,000-year-old man-made pyramid, with “cement” between its layers.", "n": "The 2023 paper was retracted over dating errors; there is no evidence it is man-made."}}, {"t": "Homo erectus “bukan manusia”, otak “800 cc ke bawah” dan tiada bahasa, jadi tak boleh bina tamadun.", "g": "sains", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "homa erectus yang bukan manusia itu sudah wujud 2.000.000 tahun tetapi kenapa mereka tidak dapat membela tamadun"}, {"tt": "7379042079181245697", "p": "meteor turun tu barulah tak ada binatang tu baru Allah jadikan hormon erektus ... bukan manusia"}, {"tt": "7216102252619009286", "p": "itu pada hakikatnya pada kajian saya itu bukan manusia itu adalah proton otak"}, {"tt": "7569249087174757653", "p": "makhluk yang berdiri atas 2ft ... bukan insan itu adalah homo erectus ... akalnya tak cukup"}, {"tt": "7211836865182207258", "p": "badannya dua kaki berdiri tetapi bukan manusia ... kapasiti of the brain tu dia hanya ada lapan ratus ml ... manusia ... seribu tiga ratus"}, {"tt": "7213957113687657755", "p": "homo directors ni dia punya style agak keras ... brain is molar ... sebab tu allah taala kata aku lebih tahu apa yang aku jadikan"}], "id": "S11-19", "en": {"t": "Homo erectus was “not human”, with a brain of “800 cc or less” and no language, so could not build civilisation."}}, {"t": "Sejarah manusia perlu disusun bersama perkara sam'iyyat: Arasy, Zulmatul Nur, kemudian Big Bang.", "g": "agama,sains", "id": "S11-20", "en": {"t": "Human history must be arranged together with sam'iyyat (matters known by revelation): the Throne, Zulmatul Nur, then the Big Bang."}}, {"t": "Huruf waw dalam al-Baqarah 31 menunjukkan khalifah dalam ayat 30 ialah Adam.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "huruf wow itu menunjukkan atap kepada huruf ayat sebelum itu"}, {"tt": "7569249087174757653", "p": "waw itu ataf ataupun sandar kepada ayat 30 tadi ... khalifah itu namanya Adam"}], "id": "S11-21", "en": {"t": "The letter waw in al-Baqarah 2:31 shows the khalifah in verse 30 is Adam."}}, {"t": "“Besi dari langit” turun sebagai meteor/tahi bintang; yang mengejek menunjukkan “Malaysian level of thinking”.", "g": "besi,sains", "v": "Salah", "n": "Hampir semua bijih besi Bumi terbentuk melalui proses geologi purba, bukan daripada hentaman meteor; besi meteorit hanya sebahagian sangat kecil.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "besi itu kan ada dalam surah Al hadid dan banyak yang menyebutkan bahwasanya besi ini satu satu jenis makhluk yang datang daripada langit"}], "awal": true, "id": "S11-22", "sang": [16], "en": {"t": "“Iron from the sky” came down as meteors/shooting stars; those who mock it show the “Malaysian level of thinking”.", "n": "Nearly all of Earth's iron ore formed through ancient geological processes, not from meteor impacts; meteoritic iron is only a very small fraction."}}, {"t": "Melayu terbang “ada dalam kitab-kitab hikam”; Melayu bangsa tua yang banyak perkara mistik.", "g": "mistik", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "Melayu terbang ke semua apa semua itu ada dalam kitab ah ada kitab-kitab hikam"}], "id": "S11-23", "sang": [24], "en": {"t": "The flying Malays “are in the books of hikam”; the Malays are an old race with much mysticism."}}, {"t": "Pengkritik beliau biasanya daripada “golongan liberal dan non-Muslim”.", "g": "konspirasi", "id": "S11-24", "en": {"t": "Her critics are usually from “liberal and non-Muslim groups”."}}, {"t": "Ada kumpulan sengaja “mendiamkan” tamadun Pentas Sunda.", "g": "konspirasi", "id": "S11-25", "en": {"t": "Some groups deliberately “silence” the Sundaland civilisation."}}, {"t": "Gunung Padang, Angkor, Gelanggi dan Gangga Negara bukti tamadun megalit; tulisan Melayu awal tak dijumpai kerana tempatnya tenggelam.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "sebab itu adanya gunung padang sebab itu adanya angkor sebab itu adanya gelanggi"}], "id": "S11-26", "en": {"t": "Gunung Padang, Angkor, Gelanggi and Gangga Negara are evidence of a megalithic civilisation; early Malay writing has not been found because its places sank."}}, {"t": "Batu megalit ialah anugerah Allah di Timur, hasil letusan gunung berapi berjuta tahun.", "g": "sains", "id": "S11-27", "en": {"t": "Megaliths are God's gift to the East, the product of volcanic eruptions over millions of years."}}, {"t": "Firaun suruh Haman membakar tanah liat kerana Mesir tiada megalit — Allah “nak perli” Firaun kerana Timur dianugerahkan megalit bermutu.", "g": "agama", "n": "Piramid Mesir dibina daripada blok batu kapur dan granit.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "seolah-olah Allah subhanahuwataala bagi cerita tu kepada kita Al quran Allah subhanahuwataala nak perli"}, {"tt": "7708066711517302037", "p": "piramid-piramid di Nusantara ini ... bukan dalam bentuk muncung seperti di Mesir ... tujuannya untuk takruh kepada Allah ... firaun mengarahkan haman"}], "id": "S11-28", "fatal": 14, "ruj": [{"l": "Teknik pembinaan piramid Mesir (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian_pyramid_construction_techniques", "le": "Egyptian pyramid construction techniques (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Pharaoh told Haman to bake clay because Egypt had no megaliths — God was “mocking” Pharaoh because the East was blessed with quality megaliths.", "n": "Egypt's pyramids were built of limestone and granite blocks."}}, {"t": "Piramid kita dibina daripada megalit, dan megalit Nusantara ada saluran air di dalamnya.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7693544762112101640", "p": "dan piramid kita adalah piramid yang dalam bentuk persegi dan di dalamnya mesti ada saluran air piramid di kawasan sini"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "piramid alam Melayu ni Mira dia ada saluran air"}], "id": "S11-29", "en": {"t": "Our pyramids were built from megaliths, and Nusantara megaliths have water channels inside them."}}, {"t": "Angkor jauh lebih tua daripada abad ke-9; Winstedt dan Coedes hanya carbon dating bahagian luar, bukan “batang asal megalit”.", "g": "tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Batu tidak boleh di-carbon dating; Angkor Wat dibina awal abad ke-12 oleh Suryavarman II.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "dia hanya mengkaji Carbon dating yang ada di luar"}, {"tt": "7693544762112101640", "p": "kira aa yang yang carving carving kat luar carving kat luar carving kat luar"}, {"tt": "7708067513485102357", "p": "dia tidak kaji tentang hulu ataupun batu asas pembinaan angkor itu tetapi dia mengkaji tentang patung-patung"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "dia buat cover dating tu dia buatkan bahagian luar je dapatlah yang baru"}, {"tt": "7676735239233867024", "p": "walaupun pulau dia tu asas batu asas megalik tu sudah beribu ribu tahun ada"}], "id": "S11-30", "fatal": 25, "ruj": [{"l": "Angkor Wat, abad ke-12 (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angkor_Wat", "le": "Angkor Wat, 12th century (Wikipedia)"}, {"l": "Pentarikhan radiokarbon perlukan bahan organik (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radiocarbon_dating", "le": "Radiocarbon dating requires organic material (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Angkor is far older than the 9th century; Winstedt and Coedès only carbon-dated the outer parts, not the “original core of the megalith”.", "n": "Stone cannot be carbon-dated; Angkor Wat was built in the early 12th century by Suryavarman II."}}, {"t": "Aryan dan Dravidian datang kemudian dan mengukir semula batu-batu Angkor.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "mereka mengambil peluang untuk apa menukir balik batu-batu akbar itu"}, {"tt": "7694839323966967046", "p": "Aryan dan Dravidian datang kesana ke campar melalui kita juga"}, {"tt": "7591349391626079508", "p": "dia telah menukar angkur tu bangunan angkur itu dia telah tukar buat ukiran ukiran baru"}], "id": "S11-31", "en": {"t": "The Aryans and Dravidians came later and re-carved Angkor's stones."}}, {"t": "Kota Gelanggi kota pertahanan batu hitam antara Johor-Pahang; ada yang tak jumpa kerana ia “alam mistik”.", "g": "tamadun,mistik", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "gelanggi itu suatu Kota pertahanan hmm milik bangsa ini milik antara kedah antara johor dan eh pahang"}, {"tt": "7708067513485102357", "p": "gelar itu merupakan Kota batu hitam Kota pertahanan yang mana batu-batu itu dibina dalam bentuk bersilang"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "Kota gelang gelanggi antara Johor dan Pahang kota ini ialah Kota batu hitam"}, {"tt": "7676735239233867024", "p": "dikenali juga sebagai Kota batu hitam kota ini adalah Kota pertahanan"}], "id": "S11-32", "fatal": 42, "en": {"t": "Kota Gelanggi is a black-stone fortress city between Johor and Pahang; some cannot find it because it is in “the mystical realm”."}}, {"t": "Megalit Gelanggi dipasak tanpa paku — konsep Melayu yang sama dengan kapal Nabi Nuh (dusur = lubang dan tali, bukan paku).", "g": "maritim,agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "kebanyakan daripada ulama berpendapat ianya bukan paku"}, {"tt": "7694537579676454151", "p": "kapal ini tidak menggunakan paku ... kapal yang menggunakan paku sahaja kapal pecah sebab tu kapal Cina banyak pecah"}], "v": "Salah", "n": "Teknik pasak dan ikatan tali juga digunakan pembina kapal di Mediterranean dan tempat lain, dan kapal jong Cina terkenal dengan sekat kedap air yang menjadikannya sukar karam.", "awal": true, "id": "S11-33", "en": {"t": "Gelanggi's megaliths were fastened without nails — the same Malay concept as Noah's ark (dusur = holes and rope, not nails).", "n": "Pegging and rope-lashing techniques were also used by shipbuilders in the Mediterranean and elsewhere, and Chinese junks are known for their watertight bulkheads, which made them hard to sink."}}, {"t": "Patung Hindu-Buddha di Gangga Negara hanya relik pedagang; relik boleh dibawa, monumen tanda pemilik tempat (cth. Batu Bersurat Terengganu).", "g": "tamadun", "id": "S11-34", "sang": [5], "en": {"t": "The Hindu-Buddhist statues at Gangga Negara are merely traders' relics; relics can be carried, monuments mark who owns a place (e.g. the Terengganu Inscription Stone)."}}, {"t": "Batu megalit Gangga Negara dipotong tepat 90° dengan besi bermutu tinggi — bukti teknologi maju yang ditutup.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "dia menggunakan sejenis besi yang bermutu tinggi untuk memotong batu megrit dalam 90 derajat"}, {"tt": "7708067513485102357", "p": "dia mampu memotong aa memotong batu dalam bentuk 90 darjah"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "dia boleh potong nih dalam bentuk 90 derajat"}, {"tt": "7676735239233867024", "p": "potong batu itu dalam bentuk 90 darjah"}], "id": "S11-35", "sang": [5], "en": {"t": "Gangga Negara's megaliths were cut at exactly 90° with high-grade iron — evidence of advanced technology that has been covered up."}}, {"t": "Langkawi dan Gunung Jerai berusia 550 juta tahun; banyak megalit di Langkawi telah disusun.", "g": "sains", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "langkawi ini antara tempat yang tertua dia sama dengan waktunya gunung jerai 550.000.000 tahun"}], "id": "S11-36", "sang": [8], "en": {"t": "Langkawi and Gunung Jerai are 550 million years old; many megaliths on Langkawi were arranged."}}, {"t": "Kalau orang Melayu boleh sampai Madagaskar, mereka “sudah tentu” sampai ke Mediterranean.", "g": "maritim", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "kalau mereka boleh sampai ke madagaskar mereka sudah sampai ke mediteranian"}], "id": "S11-37", "en": {"t": "If the Malays could reach Madagascar, they “certainly” reached the Mediterranean."}}, {"t": "Melayu membawa rempah dan emas ke Mediterranean; Suvarnabhumi = Semenanjung, Suvarnadwipa = Sumatera.", "g": "maritim", "id": "S11-38", "en": {"t": "The Malays brought spices and gold to the Mediterranean; Suvarnabhumi = the Peninsula, Suvarnadwipa = Sumatra."}}, {"t": "Mount Ophir ada di dua tempat — Ledang dan Sumatera — maka Ophir di Nusantara.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "maut of OP ini ada dua tempat satu di geledang setengah kata geledang dan di Sumatera juga"}, {"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "oper mungkin ada dua oper boleh berlaku di bukit barisan oper juga ada di bukit ledang oper daripada perkataan Greg safir"}], "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Lokasi Ophir dalam sumber Bible tidak pernah dipastikan dan tiada bukti arkeologi yang meletakkannya di Gunung Ledang atau Sumatera.", "awal": true, "id": "S11-39", "ruj": [{"l": "Ophir (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ophir"}], "en": {"t": "Mount Ophir exists in two places — Ledang and Sumatra — so Ophir is in the Nusantara.", "n": "The location of Ophir in Biblical sources has never been established, and there is no archaeological evidence placing it at Gunung Ledang or Sumatra."}}, {"t": "Kolonial mahu padam dua perkara: kehebatan maritim Melayu dan tulisan Jawi (kerana Jawi akan dikaitkan dengan zaman Rasulullah).", "g": "konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "jangan ceritakan tentang bahasa tulisan jawi jika anda bercerita tulisan jawi sudah tentu anda akan coba mengaitkan dengan zaman rasulullah"}, {"tt": "7699362753651264776", "p": "ada dua benda yang ditutup oleh-oleh kolonial maritim jangan cerita"}], "id": "S11-40", "en": {"t": "The colonialists wanted to erase two things: Malay maritime greatness and the Jawi script (because Jawi would be linked to the Prophet's time)."}}, {"t": "Penjajah mahu Melayu percaya kapal nenek moyang hanya sampan kecil; al-Quran sebut “fulk” — kapal besar seperti gunung (beza fulk, safinah, mashun).", "g": "maritim,agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7696516130269154581", "p": "Kapal Nabi Nuh bernama Fuluk ... Fuluk ini satu pelayaran ... Fulukul Mashrun"}, {"tt": "7696545986788855047", "p": "nama kapal Nabi Nuh itulah fulkun"}], "id": "S11-41", "sang": [29], "en": {"t": "The colonialists wanted Malays to believe their ancestors' boats were only small sampans; the Quran mentions “fulk” — great ships like mountains (distinguishing fulk, safinah, mashun)."}}, {"t": "Catatan bangsa Pentas Sunda ada dalam tulisan paku Mesopotamia sebagai “Meluha”.", "g": "tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Meluhha dikenal pasti sarjana sebagai Tamadun Lembah Indus.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "catatan bangsa induk peta sunda nih ada dalam kunifon di smesa pertanian"}, {"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "maluha itu wujud sebelum zaman nabi Nuh lagi"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "meluha ini bahasa induk pantas Sunda macam mana dalil apa bukti"}], "id": "S11-42", "fatal": 11, "ruj": [{"l": "Meluhha = Tamadun Lembah Indus (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meluhha", "le": "Meluhha = Indus Valley Civilisation (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Records of the Sundaland people exist in Mesopotamian cuneiform as “Meluha”.", "n": "Scholars identify Meluhha as the Indus Valley Civilisation."}}, {"t": "“Me” dalam bahasa Sumeria bermaksud bersih; Meluha membina telaga di Mesopotamia; orientalis memesongkannya sebagai mandi campur.", "g": "bahasa", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "meluha itu ialah mer tuh maksudnya dalam bahasa kenifuan itu sumeria itu dia mengatakan bangsa ini bangsa yang bersih senantiasa suci"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "meluha ini ma tu suci ma tu dalam bahasa sumeri"}], "id": "S11-43", "en": {"t": "“Me” in Sumerian means clean; the Meluha built wells in Mesopotamia; orientalists twisted this into mixed bathing."}}, {"t": "Ur, Uruk dan Lagash ialah tiga “kampung Meluha”; bangsa Pentas Sunda sampai Mesopotamia dan Palestin sebelum Nabi Ibrahim.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "maluha ini ada tiga kampung di meja pertamia tu ur uruk dan lagas"}, {"tt": "7696544385567132946", "p": "sebelum wujud Nabi Ibrahim sudah ada kontak dengan di sini oke mesopotamia dengan di sini"}, {"tt": "7696545986788855047", "p": "ada di ur ur aa tempat Nabi Ibrahim"}], "id": "S11-44", "en": {"t": "Ur, Uruk and Lagash were three “Meluha villages”; the Sundaland people reached Mesopotamia and Palestine before Prophet Abraham."}}, {"t": "Adam dan Hawa bertemu di Jabal Rahmah, Arafah; manusia membiak dari situ lalu ke lembah Mesopotamia.", "g": "agama", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "hawa dan Adam alaihissalam berjumpa di arafah di Jabar Rahmah"}, {"tt": "7636429570836679944", "p": "manusia mestilah membiaknya di jabar rahmat di Mekah di mesopotamia ... the big migration berlaku 2 kali 1 sebelum banjir besar dan 1 lagi selepas"}, {"tt": "7708067513485102357", "p": "tauhid turun di sini di sinilah asasnya karena di sinilah alim"}, {"tt": "7696545352299695368", "p": "Adam Alaihissalam turun di al hin ... Hawa pula diturunkan ... dekat judah ... pertemuan mereka di Arafah"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "bermulanya Ihsan di jabar rahmat di Mekah sebab dia bertemu 2 tu"}], "id": "S11-45", "en": {"t": "Adam and Eve met at Jabal Rahmah, Arafah; humanity multiplied from there and then moved to the Mesopotamian valley."}}, {"t": "Pelarian Pentas Sunda berhijrah ke Bulan Sabit Subur.", "g": "tamadun", "ulang": [{"tt": "7672094182248336661", "p": "manusia ketamadunan malah bahasa itu sendiri sebenarnya bermigrasi dari pentas Sunda ke timur tengah bukannya sebaliknya"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "meluha ini ialah refugis Mira refugis yang lari pelarian yang lari ke mesopotamia"}], "id": "S11-46", "en": {"t": "Refugees from Sundaland migrated to the Fertile Crescent."}}, {"t": "Sarjana Barat mula propaganda sekitar 1800; sumber sebelum itu lebih selamat.", "g": "konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "1000 lapan ratus masihi mereka mula memperpepagandakan"}, {"tt": "7702717915912539410", "p": "orang telis yang baru mengkaji sejarah ini pada bermula 1800 Masihi sahaja"}, {"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "saya selalu sebut hanya bermula 1,800 catatan orientalis"}, {"tt": "7676739967904730369", "p": "ini hasil yang didialahkan oleh orang telis pada 1,800"}, {"tt": "7702717922329791751", "p": "yang baru mengkaji sejarah ini pada bermula 1800 Masihi sahaja"}, {"tt": "7671084149893074197", "p": "data yang bersih itu biasanya sebelum 1,800"}], "id": "S11-47", "en": {"t": "Western scholars began their propaganda around 1800; sources from before then are safer."}}, {"t": "Ada manuskrip Hikayat Hang Tuah 1758 di Leiden, lengkap A–Z, ditulis “Melayu asli” tanpa nama.", "g": "tokoh", "ulang": [{"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "original of the hantuah punya cerita saya baca"}], "id": "S11-48", "en": {"t": "There is a 1758 Hikayat Hang Tuah manuscript in Leiden, complete from A to Z, written by an anonymous “true Malay”."}}, {"t": "Versi 1805 diolah atas arahan Stamford Raffles yang mengupah “Abdullah Kundur”; Munsyi Abdullah juga “ubah data”.", "g": "tokoh,konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "dia upah dia upah nama orang tuh nama orang itu Abdullah kondo"}, {"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "dia arahkan seorang yang bernama aa Yusuf kundu"}, {"tt": "7648843742052453640", "p": "refus telah mengupah penulis buku sularatul sarati ini ... orang Melayu berasal daripada alexander negeri anak Putra pilik daripada Macedonia"}], "v": "Salah", "n": "Sulalatus Salatin dikarang sekitar 1612 oleh Tun Sri Lanang, lebih dua abad sebelum Raffles; Raffles hanya memperoleh salinan manuskripnya.", "awal": true, "id": "S11-49", "en": {"t": "The 1805 version was reworked on the orders of Stamford Raffles, who hired “Abdullah Kundur”; Munshi Abdullah also “altered the data”.", "n": "The Sulalatus Salatin was composed around 1612 by Tun Sri Lanang, more than two centuries before Raffles; Raffles merely obtained a copy of its manuscript."}}, {"t": "Meletakkan nama pengarang ialah “style Barat”; orang Melayu dulu tak menulis nama.", "g": "bahasa", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "kita orang nulis nama sebagai otta kan otta semua ni ini Barat Barat Barat punya style"}], "id": "S11-50", "en": {"t": "Putting an author's name is a “Western style”; the Malays of old did not write their names."}}, {"t": "Mempertikai kewujudan Hang Tuah ialah propaganda “Malaysian Malaysia” untuk memadam imej pahlawan Melayu.", "g": "tokoh,konspirasi", "ulang": [{"tt": "7682097271105752341", "p": "propaganda untuk Malaysia Malaysia wah hebat tak nak memunculkan kehebatan kehebatan warrior daripada bangsa Melayu"}], "id": "S11-51", "en": {"t": "Questioning Hang Tuah's existence is “Malaysian Malaysia” propaganda to erase the image of Malay heroes."}}, {"t": "Ptolemy, rekod Ryukyu dan data India menyebut Hang Tuah.", "g": "tokoh", "v": "Salah", "n": "Ptolemy hidup abad ke-2 M; Hang Tuah dikaitkan dengan Melaka abad ke-15.", "id": "S11-52", "fatal": 2, "ruj": [{"l": "Ptolemy, abad ke-2 M (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ptolemy", "le": "Ptolemy, 2nd century CE (Wikipedia)"}, {"l": "Hang Tuah, abad ke-15 (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hang_Tuah", "le": "Hang Tuah, 15th century (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Ptolemy, the Ryukyu records and Indian data mention Hang Tuah.", "n": "Ptolemy lived in the 2nd century CE; Hang Tuah is associated with 15th-century Melaka."}}, {"t": "Hang Tuah tiada kubur kerana ghaib, mengikut manuskrip 1758.", "g": "tokoh,mistik", "id": "S11-53", "fatal": 37, "en": {"t": "Hang Tuah has no grave because he vanished into the unseen, according to the 1758 manuscript."}}, {"t": "Dakwaan Hang Tuah berketurunan Cina (DNA dari kubur) ialah propaganda.", "g": "tokoh", "id": "S11-54", "en": {"t": "The claim that Hang Tuah was of Chinese descent (DNA from a grave) is propaganda."}}, {"t": "PAS sendiri kurang maklumat tentang peradaban Melayu; motto: “Peradaban Melayu adalah peradaban tauhid.”", "g": "diri", "id": "S11-55", "en": {"t": "PAS itself lacks information about Malay civilisation; motto: “Malay civilisation is a civilisation of tawhid.”"}}], "fb": "1684074636720261", "en": {"tajuk": "Dari Jalan Pahang podcast (Harakah) — for the PAS Muktamar in Putik, Kelantan", "platform": "Facebook video", "tarikh": "2026 (72nd PAS Muktamar)"}}, {"id": "S13", "tarikh": "8 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10", "tajuk": "“HANG TUAH ITU WUJUD DAN PERNAH SAMPAI KE VATICAN CITY!”", "platform": "YouTube, saluran rasmi Solehah Yaacob (2 minit 26 saat)", "baru": true, "links": [{"l": "YouTube f_yqXEgHCyY", "u": "https://youtu.be/f_yqXEgHCyY"}], "nota": "Video ini dimuat naik di saluran rasmi Solehah Yaacob dengan tajuk tentang Vatican, sempena program “Sejarah & Tamadun Melayu yang Hilang”. Solehah bercakap pada 0:00–0:25 dan 1:17–akhir; bahagian 0:26–1:16 (Belanda, Vatican, Leonardo da Vinci) dituturkan oleh Ketua Menteri Melaka, Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh, dalam majlis yang sama.", "d": [{"t": "Hikayat Hang Tuah ialah “cerita betul”; British Museum menyimpan catatan pelayaran Hang Tuah dari Melaka ke Mesir, Mekah dan Turki, dan dia menunaikan haji.", "g": "tokoh", "ulang": [{"tt": "7272734836870171906", "p": "hang tuah telah pernah ke ke Mekah telah mengerjakan haji hang tuah pergi ke Mesir"}, {"tt": "7547673578129394952", "p": "data di British library menyebut bahawasanya hantuah pergi ke Mesir dan ke Mekah mengerjakan haji ... 30 meeting di Gunung Jerai"}, {"tt": "7308131860301794561", "p": "hang tuah pergi ke aa ke ke ke ke Mesir dan ke Mekah mengerjakan haji"}, {"tt": "7694162214554537223", "p": "Hikayat hantuah cerita betul ... pelayaran hantuah daripada Melaka pergi ke Mesir daripada Mesir pergi ke Mekah kemudian dia pergi ke Turki"}], "id": "S13-01", "ts": 0, "tsSah": true, "en": {"t": "The Hikayat Hang Tuah is a “true story”; the British Museum holds records of Hang Tuah's voyage from Melaka to Egypt, Mecca and Turkey, and he performed the hajj."}}, {"t": "(Ketua Menteri Melaka, Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh, dalam video ini) Hang Tuah dianggap mitos kerana “tulisan penjajah Belanda”.", "g": "tokoh,konspirasi", "id": "S13-02", "ts": 25, "tsSah": true, "en": {"t": "(Melaka Chief Minister Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh, in this video) Hang Tuah is considered a myth because of “the writings of the Dutch colonialists”."}}, {"t": "Hang Tuah pernah sampai ke Vatican City — tajuk video di saluran rasmi beliau. Dalam video, Ketua Menteri Melaka Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh menyebut warkah dalam “kotak sejarah Vatican City” yang dilihat oleh Allahyarham Tun “Amatsarji”.", "g": "tokoh", "v": "Salah", "n": "Negara Kota Vatican hanya wujud pada 1929 (Perjanjian Lateran). “Tun Amatsarji” hampir pasti Tun Ahmad Sarji Abdul Hamid, bekas Ketua Setiausaha Negara yang menulis tesis tentang Hikayat Hang Tuah (1961) dan buku Hang Tuah: Tokoh Epik Nasional (2004); tiada laporan terbitan tentang warkah Vatican yang beliau lihat.", "id": "S13-03", "ts": 35, "tsSah": true, "fatal": 3, "ruj": [{"l": "Perjanjian Lateran 1929 (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateran_Treaty", "le": "Lateran Treaty 1929 (Wikipedia)"}, {"l": "Negara Kota Vatican (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vatican_City", "le": "Vatican City State (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Hang Tuah once reached Vatican City — the title of a video on her official channel. In the video, Melaka Chief Minister Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh mentions a letter in the “Vatican City history box” seen by the late Tun “Amatsarji”.", "n": "Vatican City as a state only came into being in 1929 (Lateran Treaty). “Tun Amatsarji” is almost certainly Tun Ahmad Sarji Abdul Hamid, former Chief Secretary to the Government, who wrote a thesis on the Hikayat Hang Tuah (1961) and the book Hang Tuah: Tokoh Epik Nasional (2004); there is no published report of any Vatican letter he saw."}}, {"t": "(Ketua Menteri Melaka, Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh, dalam video ini) Leonardo da Vinci, “arkitek kota Venice” dan pelukis Mona Lisa, menulis kagum dengan “laksamana muda dari Melaka” yang datang ke Rom berjumpa “Maharaja Rom”.", "g": "tokoh", "v": "Salah", "n": "Da Vinci bukan arkitek Venice; Rom abad ke-15/16 diperintah Paus, bukan maharaja. Tiada catatan da Vinci tentang laksamana Melaka.", "id": "S13-04", "ts": 61, "tsSah": true, "ruj": [{"l": "Leonardo da Vinci (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonardo_da_Vinci"}], "en": {"t": "(Melaka Chief Minister Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh, in this video) Leonardo da Vinci, “architect of the city of Venice” and painter of the Mona Lisa, wrote in admiration of a “young admiral from Melaka” who came to Rome to meet the “Roman Emperor”.", "n": "Da Vinci was not Venice's architect; 15th–16th-century Rome was ruled by the Pope, not an emperor. There is no da Vinci record of a Melaka admiral."}}, {"t": "Dalam nahu Arab, “haka” (hikayat) bermaksud sesuatu yang benar dan “solid”, jadi hikayat bukan mitos.", "g": "bahasa,tokoh", "ulang": [{"tt": "7691968598083947828", "p": "hikmat ni bukannya mitos mitos itu hanyalah diberi gambaran oleh penjajah"}, {"tt": "7691972162181156104", "p": "hikayat ni bukannya mitos ... sibawih telah menghikayatkan ... dia benar perkataan itu tidak boleh diubah"}, {"tt": "7694162214554537223", "p": "dia sebut haka hikayah tu bahasa asal Arab ... hikayah ini sesuatu yang solid"}], "id": "S13-05", "ts": 87, "tsSah": true, "en": {"t": "In Arabic grammar, “haka” (hikayat) means something true and “solid”, so a hikayat is not a myth."}}], "yt": "f_yqXEgHCyY", "ytStart": 0, "en": {"tajuk": "“HANG TUAH EXISTED AND ONCE REACHED VATICAN CITY!”", "platform": "YouTube, Solehah Yaacob's official channel (2 min 26 s)", "tarikh": "8 Oct 2026", "nota": "This video was uploaded to Solehah Yaacob's official channel with a title about the Vatican, for the programme “The Lost History & Civilisation of the Malays”. Solehah speaks at 0:00–0:25 and from 1:17 to the end; the section 0:26–1:16 (the Dutch, the Vatican, Leonardo da Vinci) is spoken by Melaka Chief Minister Datuk Seri Ab Rauf Yusoh at the same event."}}, {"id": "T286", "tarikh": "2 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-02", "tajuk": "Hang Tuah bukan mitos, ia kisah yang betul", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 20 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7691968598083947828", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7691968598083947828"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Tun Sri Lanang memesongkan kira-kira 30% fakta Sejarah Melayu dan sendiri mengaku serta bertaubat di masjid Pasai.", "g": "tokoh,tamadun", "p": "Tun Sri lanang banyak memisumkan lebih kurang 30% fakta sejarahnya kerana ia sendiri mengaku setelah ia bertaubat", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada sumber yang diketahui mencatat pengakuan atau taubat sedemikian oleh Tun Sri Lanang.", "awal": true, "id": "T286-01", "en": {"t": "Tun Sri Lanang distorted about 30% of the facts in the Malay Annals and himself confessed and repented at the mosque in Pasai.", "n": "No known source records such a confession or repentance by Tun Sri Lanang."}}, {"t": "Tun Sri Lanang menulis Sejarah Melayu pada abad ke-17, kira-kira 200 tahun selepas kejatuhan Melaka.", "g": "tokoh,tamadun", "p": "menulis sejarah Melayu pada kurun ke-17 setelah 200 tahun kejatuhan kerajaan Melaka", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Melaka jatuh pada 1511 dan Sulalatus Salatin disunting pada 1612, iaitu kira-kira 100 tahun kemudian.", "awal": true, "id": "T286-02", "en": {"t": "Tun Sri Lanang wrote the Malay Annals in the 17th century, about 200 years after the fall of Melaka.", "n": "Melaka fell in 1511 and the Sulalatus Salatin was edited in 1612, about 100 years later."}}], "tt": "7691968598083947828", "en": {"tajuk": "Hang Tuah is not a myth, it is a true story", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 20K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T287", "tarikh": "2 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-02", "tajuk": "Hang Tuah bukan mitos, ia cerita yang betul", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 15 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7691972162181156104", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7691972162181156104"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Tun Sri Lanang membuang sekitar 30% fakta sejarah Sejarah Melayu dan menulisnya pada kurun ke-17, 200 tahun selepas kejatuhan Melaka; beliau bertaubat di Masjid al-Rahman setelah dihukum bodoh oleh Raja Pasai.", "g": "tokoh,tamadun", "p": "Tun Sri lanang banyak memisumkan lebih kurang 30% fakta ... menulis sejarah Melayu pada kurun ke-17 setelah 200 tahun kejatuhan kerajaan Melaka", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Melaka jatuh pada 1511 dan Sejarah Melayu disusun sekitar 1612, iaitu kira-kira 100 tahun kemudian, bukan 200 tahun.", "awal": true, "id": "T287-01", "en": {"t": "Tun Sri Lanang removed around 30% of the historical facts of the Malay Annals and wrote it in the 17th century, 200 years after the fall of Melaka; he repented at the al-Rahman Mosque after being called foolish by the King of Pasai.", "n": "Melaka fell in 1511 and the Malay Annals was compiled around 1612, about 100 years later, not 200 years."}}], "tt": "7691972162181156104", "en": {"tajuk": "Hang Tuah is not a myth, it is a true story", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 15K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T09", "tarikh": "5 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-05", "tajuk": "“Melaka: sejarah yang terpadam”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 206 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7693072158355950856", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7693072158355950856"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Duit syiling “Kedah Darul Aman” bertarikh 118 Hijrah (736 Masihi) membuktikan Islam sudah ada di Kedah, dan Parameswara orang Islam.", "g": "islam", "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Gelaran “Darul Aman” bagi Kedah jauh lebih kemudian; tiada syiling Kedah abad ke-8 yang disahkan.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7621484003694103816", "p": "syiling syiling Kedah tulis belanja negeri Kedah Darul aman 1 1 8 hijrah"}, {"tt": "7602933328890809620", "p": "1 1 8 ni tuan tuan adalah bersamaan 7 3 6 Masihi"}, {"tt": "7607010163731500308", "p": "belanja Kedah Darul aman 7 3 6 Masihi bersamaan dengan 1 1 8"}, {"tt": "7546031446432025864", "p": "1 1 8 ni tuan tuan adalah bersamaan 7 3 6 Masihi 7 3 6 Masihi ni Rasulullah wafat"}, {"tt": "7611505897809939733", "p": "ni adalah duit yang 1 1 8 hijrah 7 3 6 yang tertulis aa belanja Kedah Darul aman"}, {"tt": "7625350763258137863", "p": "satu satu 8 hijrah ... belanja negeri kedah darul aman dalam tulisan jawi Arab"}, {"tt": "7654011510615805185", "p": "1 1 8 hijrah bersamaan dengan 7 3 6 sudah ada kerajaan tapi di Kedah ni orang persendirian tak boleh buat duit dia mesti penguasa"}, {"tt": "7330628080903408898", "p": "118 Hijrah bersamaan dengan tahun 736 Masihi"}, {"tt": "7596652569024285973", "p": "beli Kedah Darul aman 1 1 8 hijrah 1 1 8 hijrah bermakna 7 3 6 Masihi"}, {"tt": "7627500853011811602", "p": "belanja negeri Kedah Darul aman dalam tulisan jawi Arab"}, {"tt": "7681425975069936897", "p": "1 1 8 ni tuan tuan adalah bersamaan 7 3 6 Masihi"}, {"tt": "7669765511743409425", "p": "sekeping syiling dari seawal 736 Masihi ... diukir dengan gelaran Dar al aman"}], "id": "T09-01", "en": {"t": "A “Kedah Darul Aman” coin dated 118 AH (736 CE) proves Islam was already in Kedah, and that Parameswara was Muslim.", "n": "The title “Darul Aman” for Kedah is much later; no 8th-century Kedah coin has been verified."}}, {"t": "Pelabuhan Rotterdam menggunakan Undang-undang Laut Melaka untuk pengurusannya sehingga hari ini, disahkan muzium maritim.", "g": "maritim", "v": "Tak disokong", "id": "T09-02", "en": {"t": "The Port of Rotterdam uses the Melaka Maritime Laws for its management to this day, confirmed by a maritime museum."}}, {"t": "Kedah dan Melaka “tempat yang sama”; Melaka meliputi Perlis hingga Riau.", "g": "tamadun", "id": "T09-03", "en": {"t": "Kedah and Melaka are “the same place”; Melaka covered Perlis to Riau."}}], "tt": "7693072158355950856", "en": {"tajuk": "“Melaka: an erased history”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 206K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T288", "tarikh": "6 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-06", "tajuk": "Podcast 2.0 bersama Negarawati (3): Meluha dan Pentas Sunda", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 9 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7693545465379327240", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7693545465379327240"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nabi Nuh bukan orang pertama membina kapal kerana orang kampung yang mempersoalkan kapal di atas bukit sudah biasa dengan kapal.", "g": "maritim,islam", "p": "oh maknanya kapal pada waktu tu orang dah maklum rupanya macam mana maknanya Nabi Nuh Alaihissalam bukan orang pertama buat kapal", "baru": true, "id": "T288-01", "en": {"t": "Prophet Noah was not the first to build a ship because the villagers who questioned the ship on the hill were already familiar with ships."}}, {"t": "Zigurat Mesopotamia berbentuk empat segi seperti piramid Nusantara kerana pembinanya datang dari sini.", "g": "tamadun", "p": "kenapa boleh ada zegurat itu seperti seperti piramid piramid di sini sebab orang yang membina zigurat tuh orang datang di sini", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti arkeologi bahawa pembina zigurat Mesopotamia berasal dari Asia Tenggara; zigurat berkembang daripada platform kuil Sumeria tempatan.", "awal": true, "id": "T288-02", "en": {"t": "Mesopotamian ziggurats are square like the pyramids of the Nusantara because their builders came from here.", "n": "There is no archaeological evidence that the builders of the Mesopotamian ziggurats came from Southeast Asia; ziggurats evolved from local Sumerian temple platforms."}}], "tt": "7693545465379327240", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast 2.0 with Negarawati (3): Meluha and the Sunda Shelf", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 9K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T289", "tarikh": "9 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-09", "tajuk": "Melayu bertauhid bangkit! (Siri 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7694537111478816008", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7694537111478816008"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Juru tulis Assyria meminjam nama Kalah/Kalhu daripada Kedah Tua semasa Shalmaneser I membina Kota Kalhu.", "g": "besi,bahasa", "p": "mereka meminjam eksikon dan kod sivilisasi asal daripada kalah dan kalahan Kedah tua", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kalhu ialah nama bandar Assyria di Iraq; tiada bukti ia dipinjam daripada Kedah.", "awal": true, "id": "T289-01", "en": {"t": "Assyrian scribes borrowed the name Kalah/Kalhu from Old Kedah when Shalmaneser I built the city of Kalhu.", "n": "Kalhu is the name of an Assyrian city in Iraq; there is no evidence that it was borrowed from Kedah."}}, {"t": "Kedah Tua pada alaf ke-2 SM ialah rahim asal industri peleburan besi dunia dan pusat bekalan keluli ketenteraan terbaik.", "g": "besi,tamadun", "p": "meluah ini merupakan rahim asal industri pelaburan besi gergasi dan pusat bekalan keluli ketentraan terbaik dunia", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Tapak peleburan besi Sungai Batu bertarikh terawal sekitar 788 SM, manakala peleburan besi di Anatolia dan Asia Barat sudah wujud sekitar 1200 SM.", "awal": true, "id": "T289-02", "en": {"t": "Old Kedah in the 2nd millennium BCE was the original cradle of the world's iron smelting industry and the best centre for military steel supply.", "n": "The earliest dated iron smelting site at Sungai Batu is around 788 BCE, whereas iron smelting in Anatolia and West Asia already existed around 1200 BCE."}}], "tt": "7694537111478816008", "en": {"tajuk": "The monotheistic Malays rise! (Series 1)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T290", "tarikh": "9 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-09", "tajuk": "Melayu bertauhid bangkit! (Siri 3)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7694537435971144978", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7694537435971144978"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Tamadun awal Mesopotamia (Akkadia, Ur, Babylon) bergantung kepada eksport besi Kalah, kayu dan gaharu daripada Meluha yang dibawa armada kapal besar 'al-fulk al-mashhun', kerana dataran Iraq kuno kosong mineral dan flora aromatik sebelum banjir Nuh.", "g": "besi,maritim,tamadun", "p": "armada al fuq al mashun yang menyalurkan Logan murni grade kalaha besi kalai", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Zaman Sargon (sekitar 2300 SM) ialah Zaman Gangsa; besi belum digunakan meluas, dan barangan Meluhha dalam teks paku ialah batu karnelian, emas, kayu eboni dan gading.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7694537435971144978", "p": "armada al fuq al mashun yang menyalurkan Logan murni grade kalaha besi kalai"}], "awal": true, "id": "T290-01", "en": {"t": "The early Mesopotamian civilisations (Akkad, Ur, Babylon) depended on exports of Kalah iron, timber and agarwood from Meluha carried by a fleet of large ships, 'al-fulk al-mashhun', because the ancient Iraqi plain was empty of minerals and aromatic flora before Noah's flood.", "n": "The time of Sargon (around 2300 BCE) was the Bronze Age; iron was not yet widely used, and the Meluhha goods in cuneiform texts are carnelian, gold, ebony wood and ivory."}}], "tt": "7694537435971144978", "en": {"tajuk": "The monotheistic Malays rise! (Series 3)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 3K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T291", "tarikh": "9 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-09", "tajuk": "Melayu bertauhid bangkit (Siri 4)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7694537579676454151", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7694537579676454151"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Nama Kalah/Kalhu (pusat ketenteraan dan ekonomi) dipinjam oleh Salmanasar I dari Assyria daripada reputasi pangkalan maritim Kalah di Kedah Tua yang sudah mendominasi perdagangan besi global.", "g": "besi,bahasa,tamadun", "p": "salmanasar 1 bertindak sebagai peminjaman kod demokrata kuno terhadap reputasi pangkalan maritim kalaha Kedah tua", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kalhu (Nimrud) ialah bandar Assyria yang namanya Akkadia; tiada bukti ia dipinjam daripada Kalah di Kedah.", "awal": true, "id": "T291-01", "en": {"t": "The name Kalah/Kalhu (a military and economic centre) was borrowed by Shalmaneser I of Assyria from the reputation of the maritime port of Kalah in Old Kedah, which already dominated the global iron trade.", "n": "Kalhu (Nimrud) is an Assyrian city with an Akkadian name; there is no evidence that it was borrowed from Kalah in Kedah."}}], "tt": "7694537579676454151", "en": {"tajuk": "The monotheistic Malays rise (Series 4)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T292", "tarikh": "9 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-09", "tajuk": "Melayu bertauhid bangkit! (Siri 5)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7694537727320132882", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7694537727320132882"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal Melayu tidak menggunakan paku, hanya pasak dan tali, sebab itu tidak pernah pecah, sedangkan kapal berpaku seperti kapal Cina banyak pecah; buktinya kapal Pontian di Johor.", "g": "maritim,sains", "p": "kapal yang menggunakan paku sahaja kapal pecah sebab tu kapal Cina banyak pecah", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti kapal berpaku sentiasa pecah; jong Cina besar dan berpaku serta bersekat kedap air, manakala teknik pasak dan ikat ialah teknik tempatan yang juga ada kelemahannya.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7694537727320132882", "p": "kapal yang menggunakan paku sahaja kapal pecah sebab tu kapal Cina banyak pecah"}, {"tt": "7694537727320132882", "p": "kapal yang menggunakan paku sahaja kapal pecah sebab tu kapal Cina banyak pecah"}], "awal": true, "id": "T292-01", "en": {"t": "Malay ships did not use nails, only pegs and rope, which is why they never broke, whereas nailed ships such as Chinese ships often broke up; the proof is the Pontian ship in Johor.", "n": "There is no evidence that nailed ships always broke up; large Chinese junks were nailed and had watertight bulkheads, whereas the peg-and-lashing technique is a local technique that also had its weaknesses."}}, {"t": "Raja Assyria Shalmaneser I meminjam nama 'Kalah/Kalhu' (pusat ketenteraan) daripada pangkalan maritim Kalah di Kedah Tua yang sudah menguasai besi dunia lebih awal.", "g": "besi,bahasa", "p": "selmasur 1 bertindak sebagai peminjaman kod demokrata kuno terhadap reputasi pangkalan maritim kalaha Kedah tua", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kalhu (Nimrud) ialah bandar Assyria dengan nama Akkadia sendiri; tiada bukti nama itu dipinjam daripada Kedah.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7694537727320132882", "p": "selmasur 1 bertindak sebagai peminjaman kod demokrata kuno terhadap reputasi pangkalan maritim kalaha Kedah tua"}, {"tt": "7694537727320132882", "p": "selmasur 1 bertindak sebagai peminjaman kod demokrata kuno terhadap reputasi pangkalan maritim kalaha Kedah tua"}], "awal": true, "id": "T292-02", "en": {"t": "The Assyrian king Shalmaneser I borrowed the name 'Kalah/Kalhu' (a military centre) from the maritime port of Kalah in Old Kedah, which had earlier dominated the world's iron.", "n": "Kalhu (Nimrud) is an Assyrian city with its own Akkadian name; there is no evidence that the name was borrowed from Kedah."}}], "tt": "7694537727320132882", "en": {"tajuk": "The monotheistic Malays rise! (Series 5)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T293", "tarikh": "12 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-12", "tajuk": "Melayu itu sudah tua, dulu tiada Malaysia Indonesia", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7695692528158346504", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7695692528158346504"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Sebelum Perjanjian London 1824 seluruh Alam Melayu, termasuk selatan Thai, diperintah Srivijaya dan semuanya Melayu.", "g": "tamadun,tokoh", "p": "semua kawasan alam Melayu diperintah oleh kerajaan sriwijaya dengan selatan Thai kajian saya semua ini adalah Melayu", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Srivijaya berkuasa sekitar abad ke-7 hingga ke-13 M; sebelum 1824 Alam Melayu dikuasai banyak kerajaan lain seperti Melaka, Aceh, Johor dan Majapahit.", "awal": true, "id": "T293-01", "en": {"t": "Before the 1824 London Treaty, the entire Malay World, including southern Thailand, was ruled by Srivijaya and everything was Malay.", "n": "Srivijaya held power around the 7th to 13th centuries CE; before 1824 the Malay World was dominated by many other kingdoms such as Melaka, Aceh, Johor and Majapahit."}}], "tt": "7695692528158346504", "en": {"tajuk": "The Malays are old, there was no Malaysia or Indonesia before", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T15", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "“Bukti Melayu antara bangsa teras”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 158 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "tiktok": "7696339056799763720", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696339056799763720"}], "nota": "Transkrip daripada sari kata automatik TikTok; semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Semua penutur Melayu-Polinesia — dari Madagaskar dan Filipina hingga Fiji dan Hawaii — ialah “Melayu”; Melayu di Jambi hanyalah suku kaum.", "g": "bahasa", "v": "Salah", "n": "Melayu-Polinesia ialah rumpun bahasa, bukan satu bangsa; orang Fiji atau Hawaii bukan Melayu.", "id": "T15-01", "en": {"t": "All Malayo-Polynesian speakers — from Madagascar and the Philippines to Fiji and Hawaii — are “Malay”; the Malays of Jambi are merely a tribe.", "n": "Malayo-Polynesian is a language family, not a single race; Fijians and Hawaiians are not Malay."}}], "tt": "7696339056799763720", "en": {"tajuk": "“Proof the Malays are among the core races”", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 158K views", "nota": "Transcript from TikTok's automatic captions; watch the clip for the exact wording."}}, {"id": "T294", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "Podcast bersama Gabungan Nasionalis: bukti peradaban Melayu tua", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696544385567132946", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696544385567132946"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Piramid Maya dibina oleh pemikiran dan pergerakan manusia yang berasal dari Pentas Sunda merentas Lautan Pasifik.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "mereka itu semua mereka itu dari sini pemikiran itu membawa bangun aa membuat bangunan memorial itu daripada sini", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Tiada bukti arkeologi atau genetik bahawa orang dari Asia Tenggara membina piramid Maya; piramid Mesoamerika berkembang secara tempatan.", "awal": true, "id": "T294-01", "en": {"t": "The Maya pyramids were built by the thinking and movements of people who originated from the Sunda Shelf across the Pacific Ocean.", "n": "There is no archaeological or genetic evidence that people from Southeast Asia built the Maya pyramids; Mesoamerican pyramids developed locally."}}], "tt": "7696544385567132946", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast with Gabungan Nasionalis: evidence of an ancient Malay civilisation", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T295", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "Podcast Prof Dr Solehah bersama Gabungan Nasionalis (Siri 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696545352299695368", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696545352299695368"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal sudah dibina sebelum zaman Nabi Nuh, buktinya orang kampung Nuh mempersoalkan pembinaan kapal di atas bukit.", "g": "maritim,agama", "p": "sudah ada pembuatan kapal sebelum zaman nabi Nuh ... orang kampung dia kata kau gila ke buat kapal ni atas bukit", "baru": true, "id": "T295-01", "en": {"t": "Ships were already built before the time of Prophet Noah, as shown by Noah's villagers questioning the construction of a ship on a hill."}}, {"t": "Ombak setinggi gunung (amwaj ka-l-jibal) tidak mungkin terbentuk di Mesopotamia yang landai, jadi pelayaran Nuh tidak bermula di Mesopotamia.", "g": "agama,sains", "p": "amwajun kaljibal ... kita dapat tolak benda ini sebab di mesopotamia dia tidak akan melahirkan ombak", "baru": true, "id": "T295-02", "en": {"t": "Waves as tall as mountains (amwaj ka-l-jibal) could not have formed in flat Mesopotamia, so Noah's voyage did not begin in Mesopotamia."}}], "tt": "7696545352299695368", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast of Prof Dr Solehah with Gabungan Nasionalis (Series 2)", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T296", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "Podcast Siri 3: Meluha, Kalah dan Sungai Batu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696545986788855047", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696545986788855047"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Utnapishtim dalam Epik Gilgamesh ialah gelaran Nabi Nuh.", "g": "agama,tamadun", "p": "autonavic tin itu nama gelaran Nabi Nuh", "baru": true, "id": "T296-01", "en": {"t": "Utnapishtim in the Epic of Gilgamesh is a title of Prophet Noah."}}, {"t": "Meluha bukan dari Lembah Indus kerana anjing Indus ialah anjing pariah padang pasir yang mustahil dihadiahkan kepada raja besar Mesopotamia.", "g": "tamadun,sains", "p": "anjingnya anjing paria anjing padang pasir yang pariah itu yang mustahil untuk dihadapkan", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Sarjana Asiriologi umumnya mengenal pasti Meluhha dengan peradaban Lembah Indus berdasarkan rekod perdagangan dan jumpaan meterai Indus di Mesopotamia.", "awal": true, "id": "T296-02", "en": {"t": "Meluha is not from the Indus Valley because the Indus dog is a desert pariah dog that could not possibly have been given as a gift to a great Mesopotamian king.", "n": "Assyriologists generally identify Meluhha with the Indus Valley civilisation based on trade records and the discovery of Indus seals in Mesopotamia."}}, {"t": "Punt dalam catatan Deir el-Bahri (Mesir) terletak di Nusantara, bukan Ethiopia atau Yaman, kerana kapur barus dan gaharu hanya ada di sini; rajanya digelar “Perahu” dan permaisurinya Ati.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "tidak menggambarkan keadaan di utopia dan di Yaman", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Lokasi Punt dikenal pasti sarjana di kawasan Laut Merah (Eritrea, Sudan timur, Ethiopia atau Yaman); tiada bukti ia di Nusantara.", "awal": true, "id": "T296-03", "en": {"t": "Punt in the Deir el-Bahri records (Egypt) is located in the Nusantara, not Ethiopia or Yemen, because camphor and agarwood exist only here; its king is called 'Perahu' (Boat) and his queen Ati.", "n": "Scholars locate Punt in the Red Sea region (Eritrea, eastern Sudan, Ethiopia or Yemen); there is no evidence that it was in the Nusantara."}}], "tt": "7696545986788855047", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast Series 3: Meluha, Kalah and Sungai Batu", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T297", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "Podcast Prof Solehah: istilah, Kalah dan kapal Rom", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696546793399618822", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696546793399618822"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kapal Melayu tidak menggunakan paku kerana paku menyebabkan kapal pecah, sebab itu banyak kapal Cina pecah.", "g": "maritim,sains", "p": "jika menggunakan paku dia akan pecah ya that's why banyak kapal kapal Cina pecah", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Jong Cina berpaku dan berklamp besi belayar jauh sehingga Lautan Hindi dan Afrika Timur.", "awal": true, "id": "T297-01", "en": {"t": "Malay ships did not use nails because nails cause ships to break up, which is why many Chinese ships broke up.", "n": "Chinese junks fastened with nails and iron clamps sailed as far as the Indian Ocean and East Africa."}}, {"t": "Penamaan tempat dalam Bible hanya diiktiraf oleh New York Post pada 1950.", "g": "agama,konspirasi", "p": "penamaan penamaan dalam Bible hanya diiktiraf oleh new York post pada 1950 saja", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "New York Post ialah akhbar harian dan bukan pihak yang mengiktiraf penamaan tempat dalam Bible.", "awal": true, "id": "T297-02", "en": {"t": "The naming of places in the Bible was only recognised by the New York Post in 1950.", "n": "The New York Post is a daily newspaper and not a body that recognises the naming of places in the Bible."}}, {"t": "Nama 'Kedah' dalam kamus Arab (qidh) bermaksud besi di hujung anak panah ramalan jahiliah di Kaabah.", "g": "bahasa,besi", "p": "ada qadhun itu nama besi di hujung anak panah untuk tilik nasi", "baru": true, "id": "T297-03", "en": {"t": "The name 'Kedah' in the Arabic dictionary (qidh) means the iron tip of the divination arrows of pre-Islamic times at the Kaaba."}}, {"t": "Pada 700 Masihi ahlul bait sudah datang ke Alam Melayu membawa bahasa Arab sebagai asas kerajaan Islam.", "g": "islam,tamadun", "p": "berapa ratus tahun sebelum itu 700 Masihi aa sudah datang daripada ahli baik sudah datang ke sini", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kerajaan Islam terawal di Alam Melayu yang bertarikh jelas ialah Samudera Pasai (nisan Sultan Malik al-Salih, 1297).", "awal": true, "id": "T297-04", "en": {"t": "In 700 CE the ahl al-bayt (the Prophet's household) had already come to the Malay World bringing Arabic as the foundation of an Islamic kingdom.", "n": "The earliest clearly dated Islamic kingdom in the Malay World is Samudera Pasai (the gravestone of Sultan Malik al-Salih, 1297)."}}, {"t": "Hujah Meluha daripada Lembah Indus ditolak kerana Lembah Indus tiada pokok balak, jadi Meluha membawa balak ke Mesopotamia pasti dari Nusantara.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "kita boleh tolak hujah mengatakan meluha itu katanya daripada aa aa Lembah indus", "baru": true, "v": "Tak disokong", "n": "Kebanyakan sarjana Asiriologi mengenal pasti Meluhha dengan peradaban Lembah Indus; tiada bukti ia berada di Pentas Sunda.", "awal": true, "id": "T297-05", "en": {"t": "The argument that Meluha was from the Indus Valley is rejected because the Indus Valley has no timber trees, so Meluha bringing timber to Mesopotamia must be from the Nusantara.", "n": "Most Assyriologists identify Meluhha with the Indus Valley civilisation; there is no evidence that it was on the Sunda Shelf."}}, {"t": "Garum (sos ikan Rom) sama dengan pekasam/belacan Melayu dan menjadi kesan budaya Melayu di Rom.", "g": "bahasa,maritim", "p": "dia ada juga barang barang barang yang peram tu nama dia garum", "baru": true, "id": "T297-06", "en": {"t": "Garum (the Roman fish sauce) is the same as the Malay pekasam/belacan and is a trace of Malay culture in Rome."}}], "tt": "7696546793399618822", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast with Prof Solehah: terminology, Kalah and the Roman ship", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 2K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T298", "tarikh": "14 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-14", "tajuk": "Podcast Siri 5: Keturah, Ibrahim dan Pentas Sunda", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696547301132700935", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696547301132700935"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Al-Mufassal (Jawad Ali, 12 jilid) mencatat Keturah anak angkat pembesar Kohtan (Arab) di Palestin dan pembantu Siti Sarah; selepas Sarah wafat, Ishak meminta ayahnya mengahwini Keturah.", "g": "tokoh,agama", "p": "wanita ini adalah anak angkat kepada pembesar kohtan ... pembantu kepada Siti Sarah ... Ishak itu telah meminta ayah dia kahwin dengan wanita ini", "baru": true, "id": "T298-01", "en": {"t": "Al-Mufassal (Jawad Ali, 12 volumes) records Keturah as the adopted daughter of a Qahtan (Arab) chieftain in Palestine and an attendant of Sarah; after Sarah died, Isaac asked his father to marry Keturah."}}, {"t": "Yahudi ialah ideologi, bukan nasab keturunan Nabi Ibrahim.", "g": "agama,konspirasi", "p": "rupanya jus ini ideologi dia bukan nasab baru jadi cipta nasab", "baru": true, "id": "T298-02", "en": {"t": "Jewishness is an ideology, not a lineage descended from Prophet Abraham."}}, {"t": "Yang disembelih Nabi Ibrahim ialah Ismail, dan seorang Yahudi yang memeluk Islam mengaku kepada Khalifah Umar Abdul Aziz bahawa Yahudi mengubah data kerana cemburu kepada Ismail.", "g": "agama,islam,konspirasi", "p": "yang disembelih oleh nabi Ibrahim adalah nabi Ismail tetapi disebabkan Yahudi itu sangat cemburu ... mereka telah mengubah data", "baru": true, "ulang": [{"tt": "7696921654064205072", "p": "yang disembelih oleh nabi Ibrahim adalah nabi Ismail tetapi disebabkan Yahudi itu cemburu mereka telah mengubah data"}], "id": "T298-03", "en": {"t": "The one Prophet Abraham sacrificed was Ishmael, and a Jew who converted to Islam admitted to Caliph Umar Abdul Aziz that the Jews altered the data out of jealousy towards Ishmael."}}], "tt": "7696547301132700935", "en": {"tajuk": "Podcast Series 5: Keturah, Abraham and the Sunda Shelf", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 4K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T299", "tarikh": "15 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-15", "tajuk": "Siri 7: Bukti Rom dipengaruhi maritim Melayu dalam kapal jarak jauh", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7696921654064205072", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7696921654064205072"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Kayu balak ulin dari Nusantara dibawa ke Mesopotamia untuk tiang ziggurat dan kapal; Meluha bukan dari Lembah Indus kerana Indus tiada pokok balak.", "g": "tamadun,maritim", "p": "kayu balak daripada kayu ulin dibawa ke sana untuk bina ziggurat meluha daripada Lembah indus saya tolak tidak ada pokok balak", "baru": true, "v": "Salah", "n": "Meluhha dalam teks Mesopotamia dikenal pasti oleh kebanyakan sarjana dengan peradaban Lembah Indus; tiada bukti kayu ulin Nusantara sampai ke Mesopotamia.", "awal": true, "id": "T299-01", "en": {"t": "Ulin timber logs from the Nusantara were brought to Mesopotamia for ziggurat pillars and ships; Meluha was not from the Indus Valley because the Indus has no timber trees.", "n": "Meluhha in Mesopotamian texts is identified by most scholars with the Indus Valley civilisation; there is no evidence that Nusantara ulin timber reached Mesopotamia."}}, {"t": "Garum, makanan perap orang Rom, serupa pekasam/belacan Melayu dan perkataan garum mungkin berkait dengan \"garam\", tanda kesan budaya.", "g": "bahasa,maritim", "p": "garum garum ya memang perkataan garam kah dia garam pekasam juga itu perlu dikaji lagi", "baru": true, "id": "T299-02", "en": {"t": "Garum, the fermented food of the Romans, is similar to the Malay pekasam/belacan, and the word garum may be related to 'garam' (salt), a sign of cultural influence."}}, {"t": "Menurut al-Mufassal (Jawad Ali), Keturah bukan orang Kanaan tetapi anak angkat pembesar Qahtan, pembantu Sarah; selepas Sarah wafat Ishak meminta ayahnya, Nabi Ibrahim, mengahwininya.", "g": "tokoh,agama", "p": "wanita ini adalah anak angkat pembesar kohtan dia menjadi pembantu kepada Siti Sarah Ishak minta ayah dia kahwin dengan wanita ini", "baru": true, "id": "T299-03", "en": {"t": "According to al-Mufassal (Jawad Ali), Keturah was not a Canaanite but the adopted daughter of a Qahtan chieftain and an attendant of Sarah; after Sarah died Isaac asked his father, Prophet Abraham, to marry her."}}], "tt": "7696921654064205072", "en": {"tajuk": "Series 7: Evidence that Rome was influenced by Malay maritime skills in long-distance ships", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 5K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T300", "tarikh": "16 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-16", "tajuk": "Asal kejadian Adam, insan dan keturunan Yahudi", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 39 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7697418405464362256", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7697418405464362256"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Yahudi mengatakan benih datang daripada rahim ibu supaya Ishak daripada Sarah dianggap berbangsa Yahudi, sedangkan Sarah orang Iraq atau Syria dan bukan orang Judah.", "g": "agama,tokoh", "p": "Sarah bukannya orang judah Sarah kan orang Irak ataupun orang Syam", "baru": true, "id": "T300-01", "en": {"t": "The Jews say that the seed comes from the mother's womb so that Isaac, son of Sarah, would be considered Jewish, whereas Sarah was an Iraqi or Syrian and not from Judah."}}], "tt": "7697418405464362256", "en": {"tajuk": "The origin of Adam's creation, humankind and the Jewish lineage", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 39K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T301", "tarikh": "20 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-20", "tajuk": "Kenapa tiada dalam buku teks?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7698665672229866759", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7698665672229866759"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Terdapat dua jilid dokumen Uthmaniyah yang memuatkan surat raja-raja Alam Melayu (Sultan Kedah, Johor, Bengkulu, Mindanao) kepada khalifah Uthmaniyah sejak sebelum 1700, tetapi hubungan ini tidak ditulis dalam buku teks.", "g": "islam,tamadun,konspirasi", "p": "2 jilid tebal ... surat menyurat daripada raja raja di alam Melayu kepada khalifah khalifah di Turki ... lama sebelum tu tahun 1700", "baru": true, "id": "T301-01", "en": {"t": "There are two volumes of Ottoman documents containing letters from Malay World rulers (the Sultans of Kedah, Johor, Bengkulu and Mindanao) to the Ottoman caliph from before 1700, but these relations are not written in textbooks."}}], "tt": "7698665672229866759", "en": {"tajuk": "Why is it not in textbooks?", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 6K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "T302", "tarikh": "20 Okt 2026", "sort": "2026-10-20", "tajuk": "Bahtera besar sudah wujud sebelum zaman Nabi Nuh", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18 ribu tontonan", "baru": true, "dari_lombong": true, "tiktok": "7698739768858807559", "links": [{"l": "Video TikTok", "u": "https://www.tiktok.com/@solehah_yaacob/video/7698739768858807559"}], "nota": "Dakwaan diekstrak daripada transkrip automatik video ini; petikan transkrip disertakan. Semak klip untuk ayat tepat.", "d": [{"t": "Pembuatan kapal sudah wujud sebelum Nabi Nuh, kerana kaum Nuh mengejek baginda membuat kapal di atas bukit dan faham bentuk kapal.", "g": "maritim,agama", "p": "bukan pertama untuk kapal Nabi Nuh sudah ada pembuatan kapal sebelum zaman nabi Nuh", "baru": true, "id": "T302-01", "en": {"t": "Shipbuilding already existed before Prophet Noah, because Noah's people mocked him for building a ship on a hill and understood the shape of a ship."}}], "tt": "7698739768858807559", "en": {"tajuk": "The great ark existed before the time of Prophet Noah", "platform": "TikTok @solehah_yaacob · 18K views", "nota": "Claims extracted from this video's automatic transcript; transcript excerpts are included. Watch the clip for her exact words."}}, {"id": "S12", "tarikh": "7 Nov 2026", "sort": "2026-11", "tajuk": "SembangOhhYeahh EPS 57: “Prof. Dr. Solehah KONGSI Sejarah Melayu Yang Kita Tak Pernah Belajar?”", "platform": "YouTube podcast (~1 jam 55 minit)", "links": [{"l": "YouTube oe_7Ln5-AEc", "u": "https://youtu.be/oe_7Ln5-AEc"}], "nota": "Beberapa dakwaan tambahan dari transkrip yang tiada dalam 67 entri itu ditambah di hujung.", "d": [{"t": "Gunung Jerai (550 juta tahun, sezaman Machinchang/Geopark Langkawi) ialah batuan tertua di dunia, kedua ialah Amazon.", "g": "sains", "v": "Salah", "n": "Tertua di Malaysia (Kambrium), bukan di dunia.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7696544385567132946", "p": "kita bumi tua aa okey kita lebih tua daripada Amazon"}, {"tt": "7651641045054164232", "p": "alam Melayu sudah wujud terlebih awal daripada segala tamadun yang lain ... Gunung Jerai itu sekitar 550,000,000 tahun yang silam"}, {"tt": "7625350763258137863", "p": "sekitar 550.000.000 tahun yang silam terbentuknya gunung jerai gunungan cincang di langkawi"}, {"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "gunung jerai gunung mancincang gunung yang terdapat di grade itu bertarif 550.000.000 tahun yang tertua di muka bumi yang berada di Amerika hanyalah yang ke-2"}, {"tt": "7608751810467220756", "p": "gunung dekat Greek itu aa bertarih 550,000,000 550 juta"}, {"tt": "7708067144998604052", "p": "gunung jengah gunung mancinjang di Langkawi ... sudah terbentuk 550 juta tahun yang silam. Antara yang tertua di muka bumi"}], "id": "S12-01", "ts": 3467, "tsSah": false, "fatal": 20, "sang": [8], "ruj": [{"l": "Batuan tertua di Bumi (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oldest_dated_rocks", "le": "Oldest rocks on Earth (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Gunung Jerai (550 million years old, the same age as Machinchang/Langkawi Geopark) is the oldest rock in the world, the second being the Amazon.", "n": "The oldest in Malaysia (Cambrian), not in the world."}}, {"t": "Gunung Padang piramid berusia 25,000 tahun; maklumatnya disekat oleh kumpulan yang mengubah naratif.", "g": "tamadun", "v": "Salah", "n": "Kertas 2023 ditarik balik atas alasan saintifik.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7696545352299695368", "p": "25,000 kita ada gunung padang okey makna ada orang buatlah"}], "id": "S12-02", "ts": 3700, "tsSah": false, "ruj": [{"l": "Gunung Padang & kertas yang ditarik balik (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunung_Padang", "le": "Gunung Padang & the retracted paper (Wikipedia)"}], "en": {"t": "Gunung Padang is a 25,000-year-old pyramid; information about it is blocked by groups that change the narrative.", "n": "The 2023 paper was retracted on scientific grounds."}}, {"t": "“Meluha” dalam tulisan paku ialah Melayu; “me” bermaksud bersih dan suci.", "g": "tamadun,bahasa", "v": "Salah", "n": "Meluhha = Lembah Indus.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7698739491376221448", "p": "bangsa sesudah banjir besar Nabi Nuh kawasan ini dikenali sebagai meluah ma tu maksudnya bersih luh itu ketinggian tinggi"}, {"tt": "7696545986788855047", "p": "meluha ini perkataan Mer tuh maksudnya bersih"}], "id": "S12-03", "ts": 5787, "tsSah": false, "ruj": [{"l": "Meluhha (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meluhha"}], "en": {"t": "“Meluha” in cuneiform means Malay; “me” means clean and pure.", "n": "Meluhha = the Indus Valley."}}, {"t": "Meluha datang dengan kapal besar dari timur jauh membawa emas, permata dan gaharu sebelum banjir Nuh.", "g": "maritim", "v": "Salah", "n": "Rekod Meluhha ~2200–1760 SM, selepas tarikh banjir yang beliau sendiri guna.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7693545465379327240", "p": "kamar kamar besar membawa emas murni Perak besi menghadiahkan barang barang ini kepada raja sagon"}, {"tt": "7698739768858807559", "p": "telah datang kapal kapal besar daripada daripada timur jauh dan bangsa ini dikenali sebagai bangsa meluha"}, {"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "kapal besar meluha datang ke mesopotamia membawa kayu balak kayu gaharu kapur barus emas murni perak permata melantik penerjemah resmi"}, {"tt": "7676746573841222913", "p": "sebelum zaman nabi Nuh sudah ada kapal kapal besar"}, {"tt": "7708067144998604052", "p": "membawa kayu kayu balak daripada kayu gahal ... bersama juga adalah emas murni dan juga perak ... orang yang mempunyai emas yang tidak bersih tidak boleh bersama dengan kayu gahal"}], "id": "S12-04", "ts": 5681, "tsSah": false, "ruj": [{"l": "Meluhha (Wikipedia)", "u": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meluhha"}], "en": {"t": "The Meluha came in great ships from the far east carrying gold, gems and agarwood before Noah's flood.", "n": "Meluhha records date ~2200–1760 BCE, after the flood date she herself uses."}}, {"t": "Perkataan Melayu seperti besi, tukul, perak dan mati terdapat dalam tulisan paku Gilgamesh; “besi” asal kepada barzillu Akkadia; “nyawa” asalnya nafas/nafsun.", "g": "bahasa", "v": "Salah", "n": "“Besi” dan “nyawa” kata Austronesia purba.", "ulang": [{"tt": "7672094182248336661", "p": "evolusi perkataan Melayu besi sebenarnya berkait terus dengan akar bahasa semitik kuno macam akadia dan Ibrani"}, {"tt": "7708076096859819285", "p": "terdapat beberapa perkataan Melayu seperti pukul apabila dia menceritakan tentang undang undang bersalah akan dipukul"}, {"tt": "7708067144998604052", "p": "Tukul sudah ada ... untuk membuat Tukul ada perlukan besi ... besi ini bukan hanya muncul pada zaman Nabi Daud"}], "id": "S12-05", "ts": 6523, "tsSah": false, "en": {"t": "Malay words such as besi (iron), tukul (hammer), perak (silver) and mati (dead) appear in the cuneiform Gilgamesh; “besi” is the origin of Akkadian barzillu; “nyawa” (life) comes from nafas/nafsun.", "n": "“Besi” and “nyawa” are ancient Austronesian words."}}, {"t": "Bahasa Sumeria berulang seperti Melayu, contohnya “ur-ur” (gunung-gunung).", "g": "bahasa", "v": "Salah", "n": "Contoh sebenar “kur-kur”; pengulangan lazim dalam banyak bahasa.", "id": "S12-06", "ts": 5393, "tsSah": false, "en": {"t": "Sumerian uses reduplication like Malay, for example “ur-ur” (mountains).", "n": "The actual example is “kur-kur”; reduplication is common in many languages."}}, {"t": "Tulisan Rencong tulisan pertama Bangsa Induk Pentas Sunda (bersiku kerana ditulis atas buluh); pelarian kemudian mencipta tulisan paku atas tanah liat.", "g": "bahasa", "v": "Salah", "n": "Tulis